<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Hayyoolee</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hayyooleetikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hayyooleetikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hay.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Hayyooleetikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kunni Hayyooleetiki maxaafi Isira'eeki ardi Kanaani e'yeexxe yannanaa'n, moyanji filemeexxe yanna qico'n, hexxeexxa jirte bukki asse abide'een: kunni bari Isira'eeliki ardi miseelchixxa fakke magenoonfatati Duuchchi woddike Gootti edo jalloti wo'meemmaxxe yannamman. Tinni jirtenna mayiinxe hiyyendoole «Hayyoole» hiyyemaaki jannuwwi hujeexxe hujuwwan: tenne hayyoole giddii'n heddi duulii boonike sooreessuwwaman. Insa'ne giddii'ni jannummati ege'nemeek hafuura adhdha tommenna sasekenaa'n tommenna jaanii qico'n borreeseme hedheeke Samisooni hinaa manjon.</para>
  <para style="ip">Konne maxaafi giddii'n alfinaannexxi jabaxxi barachcho Isira'eelike ardixxi gaabbe kokeesendaak insa'ne Duuchchi woddike Gootti'a anfeexxe addatensha kadda wodda; insa'ne isi'a addatemebaangi gantoole duuchchi wodda elobaaxxi calli insa'ne'ni galta'neexxa tinni kokaken. Tennenaa'ni saxxeexxi wele jabaxxi yaanenna hexxeen. Tinninna ardi Duuchchi woddike Gootti'a afeexxa addatensha xe'ishshati ba'ne insa'ne'ni geltoolenna midde aadde aangeexxi isibaa hingeexxe qixxe'n Duuchchi woddiki Gootti anjiraamman.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">A. Iyyaasuxxe reyo qico'n hexxeexxa yaane <char style="ior"><ref loc="JDG 1:1-2:10">1:1—2:10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">B. Isira'eelike ardixxa hayyoole <char style="ior"><ref loc="JDG 2:11-16:31">2:11—16:31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">C. Gargar gargar hexxeexxa Hujuwwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JDG 17:1-21:25">17:1—21:25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s1">Isira'eelk Ardi Gatteemaxxe Kenaanitoti Welti Assineeka Lola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Iyyaasu reyeechchi uduma Isira'eeliki ardi, «Kenaanito lola ke'issatee gosa no'oxxi giddii'n ayyete sirete'n duulaak?» Hine Duuchchi Woddika Gootta lanqe.<verse eid="JDG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna, «Yihudaxxi gosa edisse duuldowwaal: ani boga ookkonee insa'ne'a gicannon.»<verse eid="JDG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Yihudake gosati minik manni dayyuwwa insa'neka Simoonixxe gosaka manna «No'aa qoqqoondeke bogibaa Kenaanitote'n duulokee amme no'onni welti me'ino no'onna ha'no'aa qoqqoode bogibaa welti me'inannon insa'nee hine.» Simoonixxe gosaki manni insa'neexxa duuka me'e. <verse eid="JDG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yihudak manni welti duule. Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Kenaanitotixxe Feeriizitotixxe anga insa'nee sa'isse uwwe: insa'nenna Beezeqike manni giddii'n tomme kuma duulii manna shinne. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />Eettene bakka'ni Adoonibeezeeqinni Beezeqike boga'ni futti hineexxi isinni welti lola inbe: Kenaanitotinna Feeriizito insa'nee injifante. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Adoonibeezeeqinna ookko'ni baaje, insa'ne kinni isoo gussine abinde uduma angatikanna lekkatika abuguddo wonxe. <verse eid="JDG 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Adoonibeezeeqinna: «Angatikanna lekkatika abugudduwwa wonxeemmaki torbaan tomme moyanjuwwa qore anxi hundii'n ibbammaxxa hanba qoce'na'ni inda'nemman: aninna insa'ne'n hujennexxa fuggoxxa huje Mageni anibaa hiisseen.» Insa'nenna isoo'o Iyyerusaalemi'a aa'ne dange isinna ookkoo reye.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yihudiinxi Gosa Iyyerussaalemikanna Kebiroonika Boga Abixxineexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Yihudak manni Iyyerusaalemika boga lolle anga ibilse'ne: ardakanna wolaantichchiki birre: qachchakanna giirati gunbe. <verse eid="JDG 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yihudak manni koobatike boga'ni; Negeebi'ninna gammoojjichcha boga'n hedha'neeka Kenaanito lolatee duulle. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Yihudak manni Keebroon he'na'neeke Kenaanitote'n duulle: Kebiroon konneechchi edo Qiriyati'arbaaqi hiyyendaamman: insa'nenna Sesinii'i, Ahimaaniinna Talimayii'i lolle injifante.<verse eid="JDG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otini'eel Dabeerike Qachchika Manna Lole Injifateexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOS 15:13-19">Iya. 15:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Ookkoo'ninna Yihudaki manni Dabeerike boga'n bukki hiyye hedhee manna'n duule: eettene yanna'n qachchi «Qiriyatisefeeri» hiyyeme ye'emaamman. <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Kaalebinna «Edise Qiriyatisefeerii'i abidaa manji'a meyyaxxa belto anxa Akisaa'a heerunsiisannoni» hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Kaalebik maa'nichchi dayyi Qeneezik belti Otini'eeli ookkone qachcha edise abixxe: tennexxee Kaaleb meyyaxxa belto ifixxa Akisaa'a heerunsiise.<verse eid="JDG 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Isenna Gotoniyaliba'a daggee wodda, anni iseki huccitaaka fichcha ise'a uwwaashsha kadhatto'a jabeessite kulde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibrititotike laagadinni torbaane tomme beekolenna </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Belgeeti jabeese iso'ni kule </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hitaani. </char></note> Kaalebinna ise harrichchotenaa'ni dirriteeshanni, «Maachcho uwwonnaa hassaatte» hiyye ise'e laqe. <verse eid="JDG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Isenna «Ani'a uuteteki fichchi gammojjete kademmaxxee wodi'iinxi muumme hexxee gama'n ani'a uwwe» hite: Kaalebinna ale aadinga baleessuwwa ise'a uwwe.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yihudaxxenna Biniyaamixxi Gosa'a Midditte Eldeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Muuseek balli Qenaanitotixxi gosa Yihudake ardinni welti kande meexxetiki haqichchi wo'meemmake qachchanaa'n ke'neexxi; Yihudiinke boga'n Aaraadii'n bita'i darre'n hedheeke gammoojjichchi bogibaa me'ine: ookko marreeba Amaaleeqitotixxe oddo'n ofolle. <verse eid="JDG 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Yihudake bogiki ardi Simoonike ardinni mitteba duuleexxi Tsaafaati hiyyemaake qachchi giddo he'naammaka Kenaanito injifante; ookkone qachcha balleesineechchi uduma «Horima» hinee isi'a summa fulchchine: <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Yihudaxxi gosa Gaazaa Asiqeloonaa, Aqarooninna olla'a insa'neeka duuchcha abidde. <verse eid="JDG 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Yihudake bogike ardinni welti hedhemmaxxee tarbati boga lolle injifanteexxi abixxine: yaane kinni dhooqatike boga'n hedhemma manni sibiljiki hunjeexxa fadhadiinxa gaarre anfeemmaxxee bogakenaa'n shorra dandeennebaan. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />Muuse haaso'emmashshan Kebirooni Kaalebi'a uune: isinna sase Enaaqixxa gosa ookkoo'n shorre. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Biiniyaamixxi gosa kinni Iyyerusaalemike bogi giddo he'naammaka Iyyaabusika manna ookko'ni shorrineemmabaan. Eettene yannanaa'ni telchi qico'n Iyyaabusiki manni Biiniyaamike ardinni welti telchi qico'ni mitteba firoomme hedhate'n hinge.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eefireemixxinna Minaasexxi Gosuwwa Beetelika Boga Abixxinee Qico</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Yooseefixxi gosa Beetelike boga'ni duuldee wodda Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna insa'nenni hedhemman: <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Yooseefixxi oose Beetelika boga dooyyaaka manna ergine. Ookkone qachchiki summinna qara Looza temman. <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />Dooyya fuleek manninna qachchi giddii'n fula'neeka mitte majo afeexxi «Konne qachchibaa hitta assinee e'yinanno qico no'o'ni kuldettele mitte yaane sila ati'a assinannan.» <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Isinna qachchiinxa hula insa'ne'a leellishe: insa'nenna qachchi giddo hedheeka arda wolaantichchiki gorraane birre: ookkonee manjonna gamo isixxa duuchcha ittan tola waalle. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Iikki manjichchinna tureexxi Hiititotike bogibaa mareexxi qachcha ijaare «Looza» hiyye summa fulcheen: telchi qico'n summi ookkoneninni ye'emaan.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isira'eelto Shorriteebaaka Arda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Minaasexxi gosa Beetisaani'n, Ta'inaaki'n, Doori'ni, Yibile'aami'n, Megido'ninna qarqarake'n hedhemmaka manna shorra gophpheemmaxxee Kenaanitotinna galduma insa'neeka ookko assedhatee murte. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Isira'eeliki manni jabaata'n dagee wodda Kenaanito hunnatixxa huje insa'ne'a hujaashsha hunnati ajajaamman: kaddo malee manna duuchcha fulchineemmabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 17:11-13">Iya. 17:11-13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />Efireemixxi gosana Geezerike boga'n hedhemmaka Kenaanito shorrineemmabaan: tennexxee Kanaaniki manni ookkon insa'neni welti hedhate'ni ke'ne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 16:10">Iya. 16:10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Zabilonixxi gosa Qitirooni'ninna Benaahilali'n hedhemmaka manna shorrinemmabaan: tennexxee Kenaanito ookkoon insa'nenni weltti mitte afo'o kande hedhate'n ke'ne. Kaddo malee Zabilonike manni'a hunnatixxa huje hunjaashsha insa'ne hunnantaamman.<verse eid="JDG 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />Aseerixxi gosa Akoo, Sidoonaa, Ahilaabi, Akizibi, Hileeba, Afeeqinna Rehoobi loola'n hedhemmaka manna shorrineemmabaan. <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Tenne daafenni Aseerik manni insa'neeke bogi giddo hedhemmake Kenaanitoti welti mitteba firoomme hedhate'n ke'ne.<verse eid="JDG 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Nefitaalemixxe gosat manni Beetishemeshekenna Beeti'anatike bogi giddo hedhammaka manna shorrineemmabaan: tennexxee Neftaalemiki manni Kenaanitoti welti mitteba hedhate'n ke'ne. Kaddo malee insa'nenna Kanaanika manna hunnatixxa huje hujinsaamman.<verse eid="JDG 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Amoorik manni Daanixxe gosaka manna koobatike bogiba ookko he'naashshate malee'e diidiinke bogibaa me'inaashsha hasebaan. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Amoorik manni Hereesike, Ayyalooni Sha'alibiimixxe koobabaa'n hedhate'n ke'ne: yaane kinni Yooseefixxi oose (Eefireemixxanna Minaasexxa gosa) insa'neeke garba assine hunnatixxa huje hunjaashsha assinaamman. <verse eid="JDG 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Amoorike mannixxi gabalanna Adoomike mannixe gabalanaa'n Sela'ii'ni bita'i darree'n Aqirabiimixxe weldeenna qico'nitemman.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi Erganna Bookimike Bogi Giddo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottixxi erganna Geligeelii'n Bookimi'a me'iteexxi Isira'eelika arda hiyyee qic, «Ani Gibtseke boganaa'n fulche edike annuwwi'a uwwonnaa kako aageennake bogibaa'a hanoo iyyedage hiyyennee qici: ‹Ha'noonni welti aagennexxa kako ijje dedhabe'non: <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />Ha'no konne boga'n hedha'neeke ardinni welti firoodiinoqqe: magenoonfanta'neka miseechchixxa fakkuwanna diiggine birre› ha'no kinni ani hiyyennexxa waaldineexxi hanooxe fedhiishshan assitine'een.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:12-13">Fula. 34:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:5">Lew. 7:5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Tennexxe ta'a konne arda ha'no edii'n gamake'n hiisabe'noxxa ege'ne: insa'ne ha'no'a naapha kandaan: dharichchi magenuwwi insa'neeki gufote ha'noo'n kadaan» <verse eid="JDG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi erganji konne hiyyichcho Isira'eelike ardi duuchchi'a haaso'ee wodda Isira'eeliki ardi hafuura gikki asseexxi oodhe: <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Ookkone boonchonna Bookimi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Bookimi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotixxe tikanni Oodhaakera hiyyaten</char></note> hine ye'nechchi tenne daafenniten. Insa'neenna eettene bakka'ni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolcha shiqinshe.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyyaasuxxa Reyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Iyyaasu arda ifika geegeesichchi uduma mitti mittiniing Isira'eelk mini hadi boga dhaalatee'e ifi fike geegibaa me'ine. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Iyyaasuke baro'ninna isi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelike ardi'a hujeexxa lumollamma yaane uuddeexxi geedhe hexxeeke baro duuchcha'n ardi Duuchchi Woddika Gootta magenoonfatte. <verse eid="JDG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottik erganji Neewek belti Iyyaasu dhibbanna tomme wogga geye lummedhe: <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Isinna koobatike Efireemike boga'n hexxeexxe Ga'ashi koobabaa'n middi darre'n hedheke isinge bogi giddo «Timinaati Seeraahi» hiyyemaaba moogemeen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:49-50">Iya. 19:49-50</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JDG 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Iitti ila duuchcha muddeechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna isi Isira'eelike ardi'a hujemmaxxa eloxxa yaane egendeebaaxxi udumixxi ila dagge.<verse eid="JDG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isira'eeliki Ardi Mageno magenoonfata Waalee qico</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Konneechchi uduma Isira'eeliki ardi elobaaxxa huje hujati Duuchchi Woddika Gootta elobaaxxa yaane hunje. Aliimi hine ye'na'neeka dharichcha magenuwwa magenoonfante: <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Gibtsee'n fulcheeke Duuchchi Woddika Gootta edike insa'neke annuwwike Mageni'a ergatema waalle; qarqarake'n hedheeki ardi magenoonfata'neeka dharcha mageno magenoonfatate'n ke'ne: konneechchuwwa sagadati Duuchchi Woddika Gootta mufachchiinse. <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />Insa'nenna Dada Duuchchika Gootta magenoonfata waalleexxi «Ba'oolinna Asitaarooti» hiyyendaaxxa miseelchixxa fakkuwwa magenoofante. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Tennenaa'n kexxeexxa Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelike arda'n lumoshsha mufate: saamake mannixxe anga'ni insa'nee sa'isse uwween: qarqarake'n hedhemmake naapha'ni wocci asse. Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eelki ardi naapha lole ifinaa'ni hoyyedha dande'a gophe. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Isira'eelki ardi lolakee fuleexxe qixxe duuchcha'ni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti insa'ne'ni edise haaso'emashanna kakateemmashanni injifateemashsha Dada Duuchchik Giittixxi anga insa'ne'ni lolidaama. Tennennaa'ni kexxeexxa insa'ne lumoxxe rakko'n inbe.<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti tenne bokkaametixxe anganaa'n anjirtaaxxa hayyoole insa'ne giddii'n file. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Yaane kinni Isira'eeliki ardi insa'neke sooreessuwwi'a ajajema ginbe; Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a anfeemmaxxa xuurameessuwwa xe'insheexxi dharcha magenuwwa sagande: annuwwi insa'nekinna Dada Duuchchike Goottika ajaja ulfeessaamman: insa'ne kinni annuwwi me'eeka ora hordonfebaan. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hayyoole fileexxe yanna'n isi hayyoolndi welti hedhemman: insa'nee shorra'nemmakenna miicammake naaphixxe buuttonn ardi raara wodda Duuchchi Duuchchi Woddik Gootti insa'nee mararaammaxxee hayyooletike baro duuchcha'n naaphiinxe anganaa'n insa'nee gargaaraamman. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Yaane kinni sooreesi reyaa wodda hinge wele dharichcha magenuwa hordofati; isoo ulfeessatinna magenoonfatati annuwwi irra fuggoxxa yaane huja'ni elobaaka adaba waalleemmabaan. <verse eid="JDG 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Tennexxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelike arda'ni mufateexxi hiyyee qici, «Kunni gosa gosak ardi ifike annuwwinni kako aagemaxxa yaane hujete'n hosinsebaan seerakanna heqqe'nebaan. <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />Tennexxe Iyyaasu reyeechchi uduma bogi giddo hedhemmaka manna mittekanna fulchinebaan. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />Iittanni kunni Isira'eelik ardi edike annuwwi insa'neekishsha Duuchchi Woddike Goottika ora hordofaaxxanna hordofabaaxxa afatee konne arda imaaniinsha assedhe hega insa'ne uudatiten.» <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Tennexxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Iyyaasuxxe anga'n sa'isse uwwat ookkone gosa gosatika arda hirbange'n fulcheban.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="s1">Shorremebaang Bogange'n Gateeka Gosa Gosaka Arda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Ookkone wodda Kenaanike bogi giddo hedhemake lola'ni leenjo adhdhebang gateek Isira'eelk gosa gosaka arda hega uudate'e Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ookkone boga'ni waalke ardi konneechinn butti'a hedheeken. <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />Isinna tenne'e asseechchi edo loliinxa leenjo afebaaxxi Isira'eelixxi horte hitta loldaa qico barachchiisatee calla hiyyeeten. <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Bogake'n gatemmar ondi Filisixeemik ardik sooressuwwi, Kenaanito, Sidoonitonna Ba'aalihereemmixxe koobabaa'ni Hamati qico'n Libaanoosixxe koobuwa'n hedha'neer Hiititemman. <verse eid="JDG 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Insa'nena Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Muuse darre'n edike annuwwi'a uwwemmaka ajajuwwa Isira'eelka arda ulfeessinaaxxanna ulfeessinabaaxxa afatee Isira'eeli'a hega uudatemman. <verse eid="JDG 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Konne qicinn Isira'eelik ardi Kenaanito, Hiitito, Amoorito, Feeriizito, Hiiwaatonna Iyyaabusiton mitteba hedhate'n kexxe. <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Isira'eelinna Dubarra insa'neeka aaxxe: ifika dubarranna insa'neexxe labbaxxe oose'a aadhinse; magenuwwa insa'nekana magenoonffante.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Isira'eelik ardi Duuchchi Woddik Gootti edo elobaaxxa yaane huje; Duuchchi Woddika Gootta ifika Magenonna waalleexxi Ba'aaliinna Asheeraa'a magenooffante: <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Tennenaa'n kexxeexxa Duuchchi Woddik Goottixxi mufe Isira'eelik arda'n ibbe: Mesiphexoomika moyanjo Kuushaanii'i Feeshe'atayimixxe anga'n sa'isse uwwe: insa'nenna Kushaani Riishe'atayini'a saddeeta wogga garbumma galle. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eeli Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa raarte; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna insa'ne'e anjiraaka Kaalebika maa'nichcho Qeneezika belto Otini'eeli'i ke'isse. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottik hafuur iso'ni dirre: isinna Isira'eeli'n sooreessa kade; isinna lolakee fulee wodda Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mesiphexoommiyaka moyanjo Kuushaani Feeshe'atayimi isixxe anga'ni sa'ise uwwe: isinna Kushaani Riishi'atayimi'i injifate. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Bogake'n shoole tomme woga'a nage'i kade tureechi uduma Qeneezik belti Otini'eeli reye.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ehuudi'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Isira'eelik ardi higgeenni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo elobaaxxa yaane hujje; insa'nenna tennee assineemmaxxe Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mo'aabika moyanjo Egilooni Isira'eeli caala jabaataashsha asse. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Egilooninina Amoonitotanna Amaaleeqito malcheexxi Isira'eel'i lole: temirk haqichi xuphphi hiyyeeka Iyarkoka qachcha anga ibirse'ne. <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Isira'eelik ardi tommenna saddeeta wogga Mo'aabika moyanjo Egilooni hunda garbumma gale.<verse eid="JDG 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Higgen Isira'eelik ardi Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa raare: Duuchchik Woddik Goottinna Binyaamito Geeraka belto bitaattichcha Naa'oodi'i leexa fulchaashsha ke'isse. Isira'eelik ardi Eehuudi'ni irbo uuneexxi Mo'aabika moyanjo Egiloonibaa ergine. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Eehuudi hojja onde tomme saanti meetire geyaak lamiin gama'n qara afeeka wolantcha ifi'a hujise middi darrexxe luqqe'n seemma giddo ka'le: <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Irbotanna furdake Mo'aabike moyanjo Egilooni'aa adhdhe mare: <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Ehudi irbo moyanjoke'e shiqisheechchi uduma irbo abixxeemmaka manna hadi'aan hinge me'inaashsha asse: <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Ehudi kinn umi isinginni Geligeeli bira xabbine kaanseeke adibaaretike kinjuwwiba'a wirri hiyye ture: Egilonba'a higeexxi «Moyanjo ifike yaadinni ate'ni sho'e kulaannexxe yaane hexxeen.» Isinna «Sammi hiyyi.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 3:19">Tennexxe moyanjinna «Amme mee mittele gadho turre!» Hiyye insa'nena madadingi gadhi'a fule.<verse eid="JDG 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Eettene yanna'n moyanji xellephphoote'ni hedheeke qiidaxxa kuta'n qofit hedhe'na, Eeuhudi isibaa shiqeexxi «Magenibaa'n ati'a kulemeeke dhaansa afeennen.» Moyanjinna qophphi hiyye uure. <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />Eehuudinna wolaantichcha middixe luqqenaa'n bita'ixxe angan luqqisexxi moyanjiinka godoba ote: <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />Gonofi midde gatebaang wolaantichchi hedheeshshann godobake'ni danqareme duddurokenaa'ni xalli hiyye fule: mooro'i wolaantichcha buqe: Ehudinna wolaantichcha moyanjiinke godobanaa'n gosha gopheemmaxxe'e madhuma lo'o hite. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Ookkonneechi uduma Eehuudi gadhi'a fule: cufanakanna iso'n danqare. <verse eid="JDG 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Ehudi me'echi uduma moyanjuwiink erganjuwwi cufani danqaremee qico marre uunde: yaane kinni moyanji fooli'ake'n tureechcho insa'ne'n labbe: <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Yo'oshsha gadhonni turre: yaane kinn cufan banema hine uunde gonpheexxi danqarsanjo aa'ne cufana banne: ookko gootti insa'nek reyee ba'linnange'n wabbi hiyye fanxaraaree'naa uunde.<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Insa'ne ookkoon uurrine heqqe'na'na Eehuudi qeeredhe me'emman: xabbine kaanseek adibaaretika kino sa'e Seeritayimi'a baaje: <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Ookko'o koobatike Eefireemike boga'n geyeeshshann Efireemike kooba callike boga'n malagata ufuufe: Isira'eelik ardinna isixxe akeetenni duuka hordonfe dirrine. <verse eid="JDG 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Isinna insa'nee hiyyee qici, «Ane'e hordoffe! Duuchchi Woddik Gootti naapha ha'nooka Mo'aabito anga ha'nooxxe'n sa'isse uwwaan.» Tennexxe insa'ne Ehudi'i hordonfe dirrine; Ookkoneechchi uduma Mo'aabito Yordaanoosii'i foofammaka galaana abixxati ookkone ora mitti manji midde sa'aabaashsha kunte. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Eettene barra'n calla tomme kuma geyaaka filemeeka Mo'aabitotika sannachchuwwa shinne: insa'ne giddi'n mittikinna baqate fuleek hedhebaan. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Eettene barra Isira'eeli Mo'aabito lolde injifatte: bogakeenna saddeeta tomme wogga duuchcha nage'i kade.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shaamigar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Ookkoneechchi uduma hedhemmaki sooreessi Anaatike belto Shaamigaaritemman. Isinna jaane dhibba Filisixeemika manna sangooletike gaafinn shiye Isira'eelika arda wode.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s1">Dibooranna Baaraqi'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Eehuudi reyeechchi uduma Isira'eelk ardi higgeen Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo elobaaxxa huje huje. <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Tennexee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelito Hatsoorike qachcha'n hedhammake Kenaanike moyanjo Liyaabi'ni insa'nee sa'isse uwwe. Sannachchuwink sooressi ardiinke boga kaddeeke Haroosheetike qachcha'n hedhaammake Sisaaratemman. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Yaabin sallane dhibba gaaruwwa afedheeman: eetene Isira'eeli'i lame tomme wogga yo'oshsha rakkise: okkoneechchi uduma Isira'eelk ardi gargaaraashsha Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa raarre.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Ookkone wodda Lafidootixxi are «Diboora» hiyyendaaxxi wabeekatemman: isenna ookkone wodda Isira'eelike ardixxe sooreettemman <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Tinni wabeekitte koobatike Efireemike boga'n Raama'ninna Beeti'eelixxe oddo'n hedheeke Diboorake Timaarike haqichchi hunda ofolde murtaammaxxe'e Isira'eelk ardi murte alfatee'e isebaa mara'nemman. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Abini'aamika belto Baaraqi'i Nefitaalemika qoobbo kaddeexxe Qaadeesike qachchiba'a ye'isseexxi hitee qici: «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelik Mageni konne ajaja ati'a uwwe hiyyee qici ‹Nefitaalemi'inna Zabilonik min hadinaa'n tomme kuma manna fildettexxi Taaboorixxe koobabaa aaxxe mari. <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />Aninna Liyaabisek sannachchik ajajjallo Siisaara sarageeluwwa ifikeninna sannachchuwwik welti Qisoonike galaanibaa lolakee dagaashsha tirtirsanon; isoonna anga atixxe'ni sa'isse uwwanon.› »<verse eid="JDG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Baaraqi ise'e, «Ati aninn welt me'itottole aninna me'anoni: duuka anxa me'a gophphottole kinni aninna marabo'non» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Isenna hiissiteexxi, «Eloxxeni aninna atinninni welti me'annon; yaane kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Siisaaraa'a meyyaxe'e sa'isse uwwammaxxee injifattottolenna ulfina alfitabexxon» hite. Tennexxe Diboora Baaraqiininni welti Qaadeesi'a duulde. <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />Baaraqinna Nefitaalemikanna Zabilonika mini hado Qaadeesi'a ye'ise: insa'neba'n tommi kumi manni duuka isixxa hordofe: Dibooranna welti duulde.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Ookkone wodda iikki Qenaanichchi Hebeeri, Muuseka ballo Abaabixxe oosenaa'ni wele Qeanaatona'n gargar hige Qaadeesi bira Tse'ineenimi hiyyemaake booncho'n hedheeke lumoke qilxi bira duunkaana ifika olteemman.<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Abini'aamik belti Baaraqi Taaboorixxe koobaba me'eexxa Siisaara'n kulle <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />Siisaara sallane dhibba sarageeluwwanna isinni welti hedhemmaka sannachchuwwa duuchcha wele ardinke geego kademake Haroosheetii'n Qisoonike galaaniba'a bukki asse.<verse eid="JDG 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Diboora Baaraqi'i «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Siisaara'a anga atixxe'n sa'isse uwwa'neexxi barra telchote kaddemmaxxe'e ke'i! Yoona Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atee akeekaan» hite: Baarqinna tomme kuma sannachchuwwa abixxe Taaboorixxe koobabaa'n dirre. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Siisaaranna sarageeluwwa duuchcha Baaraqi edo wolaantichchik injifatemeexxi udumi'a baqantaasha asse; Sisaaranna sarageelakenaa'n dirreexxi wonshe baqate. <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Baaraqinna sarageeluwwakanna sannachchuwwa ardiink geego kadee'ek Ariisot Haroosheeti qico'n shorre: Siisaaraka sannachchuwwa duuchcha wolaantichchik shinne: mitti manji midde gateeban.<verse eid="JDG 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Hatsoorik moyanji Liyaabin Habeerike mini hadinni welti nage'ik hedhaamaxxe'e Siisaara baqate Qenaanichchi Hebeerxe arke Yaa'eelike duunkaanebaa e'ye. <verse eid="JDG 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Yaa'eelinna Siisaaraa'a qophphexxo'a fuldeexxi «Anke gootta amo duunkaane anxe'ni e'yi» hite: isinna e'yee wodda ise seemmat buqqe:<verse eid="JDG 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Siisaaranna «Amo ballo yo'oshsha dheebo'enen wede'e ha'wonna uwwi» hiyye. Isenna adotika qoonjo bande ha'waashsha uute; higgeeni iisite buqqe.<verse eid="JDG 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Ookkoneechchi uduma isi isee «Duunkaaniinxe hula edo uurri;» huuni manjinna dageexxi «Kaba manji hedhee?» Atee hiyyoole atinna «Hedhebaani» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Yaane kinn Sisaara yo'oshsha gophpheemmaxxee cokkokki hiyye diiphee; ookkoneechchi uduma Hebeerixxi are Yaa'eeli duunkaaniinxa kaaso abideexxite laanchite isibaa shikki hite; isenna eettene kaasonni isixxe manshaka guuna urte buttinake'ni moxxi assitee'naa isinna reye.<verse eid="JDG 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Baaraqi Siisaaraa'a shorra'n daga wodda Yaa'eeli qophexxo'a duunkaani giddii'n fuldeexxi «Kabaa amo! Ati hassatteka manjo leellishannon» hite. Eettene yanna'n duuka isexxa e'yeeshshan duunkaaniinxi kaaso Sisaarake guuna'n gannendee'na'aa renshi diriireexxa uude.<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />Mageninna eettene barra'n Isira'eelika arda Kenaanike moyanjo Liyaabin'i anga insa'nexxe'n sa'isse uwwe.<verse eid="JDG 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Insa'nenna booso isixxa balleessinaa qico'n Isira'eelk ardi Liyaabini'ni itti jabaate.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s1">Dibooraxxanna Baarqixxa Faaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Eettene barra Dibooranna Abini'aamik belti Baaraqi konneechin butti'a hexxeexxa faaro faarsine:<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />«Sooreessuwwi Isira'eeli'i akeekemmaxxe'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:2">ardi kinna ifixxe eeyyan shiqemmaxxe:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:2">Duuchchi Woddika Gootta galateeffatte!<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />«Ha'no moyanjuwwaa laqqee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:3">Ha'no akeekisano caqasee!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:3">Ani Duuchchi Woddika Gootta faarsaannen:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:3">Isira'eelika Duuchchi Woddika Gootta Mageno saadaannen.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />«Ee, Duuchchi Woddik Gootti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:4">Seyiirii'n kexxete wodda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:4">Eedoomike boga'n mammarendette wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:4">bogi linqi linqi hiyye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:4">Iimuwwa xeena uute:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:4">eeti! Duumanchi giddi'n wodi'i yaa'e.<verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Isira'eelike Mageni edo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:5">Siinaxxe koobake Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:5">koobuwwa linqi linqi hite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:18">Fula. 19:18</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />«Anaatik belti Shaamigaarina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:6">Yaa'eelike baro'n ori duuchchi urme gate;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:6">Siiraraxxi dadaltuwwa laayyo kuta'ni me'amma bogi giddii'ni sa'namaban:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:6">ora me'ammakiirinna sho'ome laayyo laayyo me'inaaman.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Ati Diboorate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:7">Isira'eeli'a amate kadde kexxattoxxe'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:7">Isira'eeli'ni kexxeexxi hunnaammeeyye kutti hiteen.<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Isira'eelki ardi konnechchi edo ege'nebaak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:8">wele bogixxa fakkuwwa fi'linee wodda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:8">bogake'n bagedi ke'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:8">shoole tomme kuma Isira'eelike ardanaa'n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:8">wolaantichanna bagedo abixe'ek mitti manjinna hedhemmabaan!<verse eid="JDG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Qalbe Isira'eelik loliinke ajajalluwwin weltiten:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:9">eeyante ifixxin gammade qophpho'eekinn weltiten:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:9">Duuchchi Woddika Gootta galati geyoon!<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />«Ha'no kooreexxe golallamma harruwwa'n gulufine mammarendina'neek;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:10">ha'no seense giisineexxe elolla gilaase'n kitindineek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:10">ha'no lekkati mammarendina'neekiir,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:10">tenneera haaso'we.<verse eid="JDG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />Faarorka hafuura<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yookaan moqiduwwiinka manna</char><char style="ft" closed="false">hiyyeme'e tikema dande'aan.</char></note> laqqe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">tinninna Duuchchi Woddike Goottike qullummatixxi huje</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:11">Iikki loliink manninna Isira'eeli giddo asseemmaxxa qalli assaan.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:11" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:11">«Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddike Goottik ardi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">ookkone qachchibaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yookaan olla'uwwinbaa</char><char style="ft" closed="false">hiyyeme tikema dande'aan.</char></note> adadde dirre.<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />‹Tee Diboora! Dammaqi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:12">Dammaqi! Faarotanna kexxe faars!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:12">Koo! Abini'aamike belto Baaraqi ke'i!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:12">Booji'witetteka manna aaxxe ke'i!›<verse eid="JDG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />«Ookkoneechchi uduma gateek ardi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:13">jalqabuwwiinba'a me'ine:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:13">Duuchchi Woddik Goottik ardi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:13">loliinke worbi manjishsha anibaa dage.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Edo Amaaleeqito he'namak Efireemik sannachchuwwi dage:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">welkinna Biiniyaamii'n dage.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:14">Makirik sooreessuwwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">Zabiloni'n moyanjummatixxa siqqo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">abixaakiir dage.<verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Yisakoorik sooreessuwwi Dibooranni welti dage:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">Yisaakoorinna Baaraqi dage:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">duuka isixxa wolo'otiba'a hordonfe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:15">Yaan kinni Roobelik mini hadi lameba qoodeme:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">dagate'e yookaan waalate godoba gure.<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Gedhebiinxe goodhe giddo maye'e ofoldette?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:16">Gedhebo ye'atixxa fiissa caqasateetee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:16">Roobelike awurajuwwa'n heddo qalbetixxi qo'nisa hexxemman.<verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Gaadik mini hadi Yordaanoosi wido qubate:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:17">Daanik mini hadi maye'e hobolo giddo hekki hiyye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:17">Aseerik mini hadi abbaayyatixxe qoonne'n gate:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:17">galaani qarqara'n ofo'le.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Zabilonk gosa gosak ardi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:18">reyote'e ifi sa'isse uwwe.<verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />«Megidoke wede'i bira Ta'inak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:19">moyanjuwwi daggeexxi lole:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:19">ookkoneechchi uduma Kenaanika moyanjuwwa lola ibe:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:19">insa'nenna sibiljo birre boojinebaan.<verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Iima urjuwwati lolende:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:20">yaadik Siisaaraanna lolle.<verse eid="JDG 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Qaran ege'nemeek Qisoonik galaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:21">insa'ne'e gure bire;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:21">tee! Lubbo anxe! Itti jabaat!<verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />Fadhado gulufeek manni dagaa wodda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:22">hirbi fadhadiink dindinsotishsha kade.<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottik erganji hiyyee qici:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:23">‹Meerozii'i badde!›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:23">‹Ookko'o hedha'neka arda duuchcha badde!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:23">Jajjaba mannike lolanaa'n Duuchchi Woddik Gootta gargaaratte'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:23">Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe gamo kande uurinno'a dangebaan.›<verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />«Qenaanichcho Hebeerixxi are Yaa'eeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:24">melaalle duuchcha caala ise eebbisendowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:24">duunkaani giddo hexxa'neexxe melaalle duuchcha irra ise eebbisendeexxe kaddowwaal.<verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Sisaara wode'e a'naa uwwi hiyye:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:25">ise kinn ado isi'aa uute:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:25">lumollake uunammake qoonjo'n itichcha isi'a shiqishshe.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Iittanni isenna mitte anganni dunkaaniika chikaala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:26">middixxe anganni hujalluwwiinxa faase abixxite:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:26">Siisaaraka umo gandeexxi hashakk assite:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:26">guunake'n chikaala gobbe waalde.<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Lekka isexxi hunda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:27">wabbi hiyye ibe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:27">Ookkonna lekka isexxe'n gonbiseme;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:27">ookko'o ibemaba reye.<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />«Siisaaraxxi ama masikootetenaa'n uuddaamman:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:28">ceeqqise qo'akenaa'n uudde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:28">‹Belti ankixxi gaare maye'e turte?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:28">Gaaruwwatike googeessik hirbi maye'e hekki hiyye?› Hite laqqe.<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Beekkumik ege'nendeexxi isexxi melalle hiisichcho uute:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:29">isenna ifi'aan hiissichcho alfexxe.<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />‹Boojinemmalcho qoodemate'n he'neba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">Mitte yookaan lame danchalluwa mitte mittenge labbali'a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">Siisaara'a gargaritti hexxeexxe bifan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">danchondeexxa booji'endeexxa seemma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">Ani'anna goobiinxa lame dachcha'in</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">mirqendeexxa borritte seemma?› Hite.<verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />«Ee, Duuchchi Woddike Goottaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:31">Naapha atika duuchcha konnee qicinn balleessi:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:31">jaaluwwi atik kinn soodimariinxe arishshoshsha wa'a hiyyowwaal.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Ookkoneechchi uduma bogi shoole tomme wogga'a nage'a alfe.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s1">Gedewoon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Isira'eelik ardi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo fuggoxxa huje: Isinna Midiyaamike mannixxe anga'n insa'ne sa'isse uwwe: insa'nena torbaane wogga duuchcha moone galchine: <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Midiyaamitotixxi hunna Isira'eelke manna'n itti jabaatta'n me'ite: insa'neexxe buuton Isira'eelik manni sho'omaa booncho wolo'onna kollo giissedhe. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Isira'eelik ardi sanne facaansaa wodda Midiyaamito, Amaaleeqitonna middik manni daga'n lola ke'isaamman. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />Insa'nenna ookkone boga'ni ofoleexxi Gaazake bogi giddo hexxeexxa midha balleesine birraamman: gedhebiinka, horiinkanna heddo harre oonfe insa'nenaa'ni adhdhinaammaxxe'e Isira'eelik manni'a mitteechchonna gatinsaammabaan. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Insa'ne ifika horenna ifika duunkaanuwwa adhdhineexxi dangaa wodda koro'miisiinke haagana fakkaantaamman: insa'nenna gaaluwwa laakkoonne dhaqqanbabaa qico'ni heddokeman. Insa'nenna dange boga dibbeessinaamman. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Tennexxe Isira'eelik ardi Midiyaamike mannixxe buutonni rakko insa'ne gelte: insa'ne gargaaro'a Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa raarre.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Isira'eel ardi Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Midiyaamike mannixxe anganaa'n gargaaraashsha raarre wodda, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelike ardibaa mitte wabeeko erge: iikki wabeekinna Dada Duuchchike Gootta Isira'eelik Magenibaa'ni aadhe dageexxi erga konneechchin butti'a hexxeen, «Ani garbumma hexxineemmake Gibtseke boganaa'n ha'noo fulcheennen: <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />Gibtseke ardanaa'ninna konne boga'n ha'no rakkisammake arda duuchchanaa'n ha'noo wodennen. Ani ha'noo edi'ni insa'nee shorre'e fulche'e boga insa'neekanna ha'no'aa uwwennen. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />Ani Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'nooke Mageno kadennexxanna ta'a boga insa'neeka dhaaldinemmak Amooritotika dharichcha magenuwwa magenoonfatinabaashsha ha'no'n kuleennan: ha'no kinni anxa laqqinebaan.»<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddike Goottik erganji «Ofira» hiyyemaake loolibaa dageexxi Abi'eezerixxe sannenaa'n ilemeeka Iyyo'asike fichchi giddo hedheeke haqichchi hunda ofo'le Iyyo'aasik belti Gedewoon Midiyaamito isoo uudabaashsha sho'omeexxi woyine miincamake booncho'n dinne uxxaamman. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Eettene oddo'n Duuchchi Woddike Goottik erganji iso'ni leellexxi «Ati jabakinna hunnaameessi manji! Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atinni welti hedheen.»<verse eid="JDG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Gedewooninna hiyyeeqici; «Anke gootta! Eega Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'onni welti hedheexxinni tinni rakko duuchcha hitta kadde no'o'ni dagge geltee? Annuwwi no'oki no'o'ni kulemmashshan Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hujammaxxi mambe'iinxi yaane duuchcha telcho haba hexxee? Gibtsee'n hitta fulcheexxa no'o'ni kulleemman. Yaane kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'oo waalee insa'ne eeneeshsha no'oo assinaashsha Midiyaamitotee sa'isse uwwe'en.»<verse eid="JDG 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Dada duuchchik Gootti isibaa wirri hiyyeexxi, «Kexxe me'i tenne affettexxe jabaxxe hunnani Isira'eelika arda Midiyaamitotixxe anganaa'n leexxa fulchitottaa ergaannek antebaa? Hiyye.»<verse eid="JDG 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Gedewooninna, «Hitta asseeta ani Isira'eel'i woda dande'anno? Gosa anxinna Minaaseke mini hadinaa'n hara goofaken: aninna mini hadi giddii'n hara shiixxoken» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />Dada duuchchik Goottinna «Ani atee gargaarannaxxee tennee assa dandeettatton: Midiyaamika ardanna mitti manjisha assite rubbatton.»<verse eid="JDG 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Gedewooninna hiyye hiisee qic, «Ati edo gaachchanna afoonnole ati dhugaandiin Dada Duuchchike Gootta kaddeettexxa kokachchiisaaka beessisa ani'a uwwi. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Hige tolcha shiqishe ati edo qophpheessannoxxe'e maganneten me'itoxxe.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 6:18">Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna, «Ati higge daggattoxxe turannon» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Gedewooninna ifike minibaa e'yeexxi re'etika buruusa duule; isinna tomme kiilo geltaaxxa bulle aadheexxi lebele e'yeebaaka quncisa ra'isse: maalakanna qorete'n, la'akanna meshete'n uggeexxi qilxi hunda ofoleeke iimike erganji'a aadhe shiqishe. <verse eid="JDG 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Iimatik erganji «Maalakanna quncisa rassa tenne'n uggite hana la'a duni.» Hiyye ajaje. Gedewooninna ajajemeeshshan asse. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottik erganji biri'a shikki hiyyeexxi abixxeexxe siqoxxe qaccen maalakanna quncisa tuqe: giiratinna rassatenaa'n kexxe quncisakanna maala itte: ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimatik erganji sho'ome.<verse eid="JDG 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Gedewooninna uudeek dada duuchchike Duuchchi Woddike Goottike erganjo kadeexxa afeexxi «Dada duuchchike Duuchchi Woddike Goottaa! Atixxi ergana ani edo uurite'na uudennen ani'a aanne'e!»<verse eid="JDG 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti kinni «Nage'i ati'a kadowwaal: mee co'o sodaattoxxen: rertabexxon.» <verse eid="JDG 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Gedewooninna ookko tolchimalcho giissexxi, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti nage'iinke Duuchchi Woddike Goottan» Hiyye summa fulche: (kunni tolchimalchi telchi qico'ni Abi'eezerixe sanneke bogi giddo Ofira uurre hedheen.)<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />Eettene hashsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Gedewooni'i hiyyee qici: «Atike annixxe moona giddo torbaan wogga geyeeka jibichchanna ittann wele kanna aadhi: anni atiki Ba'aali hinaaxxe fakkuwwaa hujeeka tolchimalcho diigi: isi bira hedheeka ‹asheera› hine ye'na'neeka meyyaxxike magenuwixxa fakkuwwa enqite butuchchite huni: <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Eettene oletixxe kooba iima Duuchchi Woddika Gootta atike Mageni'a eloshsha giissineeka tolchimalcho huji. Ookkoneechchi uduma langaka jibichcha aadhi: enqite butuchchite hundettexxa Asheeraxxa fakkuwwaxxa bille ha'ishshe jibichcha ookkone ciincatike tolcha assite shiqish.» <verse eid="JDG 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Gedewooninna erganijuwwi giddii'n tomme aadheexxi Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ajajemmashshan asse: mini hado isikanna qachchuwi giddo hedha'neeka manna sodaateexxi tennee yaane asseek barruunte kaddebaangi hashshatemman.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Gorsa qachchi giddik manni soodimaro ke'na wodda Ba'aali'a hujemeek tolchimalchi diigemeexxanna Asheeraxxi fakkuwwa xeerende bille fuldeexa uunde: okko'ni hujemeeke tolchimalcho'n langaka jibichcha gorraane ciincatike tochi'a shiqinsheexxa uunde. <verse eid="JDG 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Weli'aan weli «Tenne'e asseek ayyete?» Hineexxi lanqe: adda memmekinseechi uduma tenne'e asseek Iyyo'aasik belto Gedewoonite kadeexxa dhaqqanbe:<verse eid="JDG 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Iyyo'aasii'i «Ba'aalika tolchimalcho diigeexxenna bira hedheeka Asheeraxxa fukkuwwa enqe butichcheemmaxxe atike belto kadeemaxxe'e reyo isi'a hasisaamaxxe'e no'aa fulchi isoo hine.»<verse eid="JDG 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Iyyo'aasi kinni mufet iso'n ke'emake duuchcha'n hiyyee qici; «Ha'no Ba'aali'a baassitina'neemo? Yookaan anjirtino'aatee? Isi'a baassaak duuchchi soodo hosoqqe isoon shinnowwaal: yoona Ba'aali dhugaandinn magenoke kadoole ookkone tolchimalcho isinaa'ni diiga wodda ifinaa'ni silaati lolee hoyyedhamman.» <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Tennexxee insa'ne, «Isi Diige'eek Ba'aalike tolchimalcho kadeemmaxxee dande'a'noole Ba'aali umo ifingeninni ifi iimi'n lole hoyyedhowwaal» hina'n eettene barra Gede'woonii'i Yiruba'aali hiyye summa fulche.<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Ookoneechchi uduma Midiyaamito, Amaaleeqitonna middik manni mitteba bukki hiyyeexxi Yordaanoosika galaana foofe; Iyyizira'eelixxe wolo'o'n qecence. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottik hafuuri Gedewooni'n dirre; isina malagata ufuufe: Abi'eezerike mannixx sanne duuchcha isoo hordoffaashsha ye'e. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Minaasek mini hadi duuchchi manjo ergeexxi isoo hordofaashsha ye'ise; iittan Aseeri'a, Zabilon'anna Nefitaalemik mini hadi'a manjo erge; insa'nenna weli mannin welti duulo fulle.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Konneechchi uduma Gedewooni Mageno hiyyee qici, «Haasottetteshshan Isira'eelii'i anxe anga'n gargaartotta'a hassoottole <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />Dinne uxxinammaxxe aldumme'n gola'leeka gedhebiinxa orda uggannon; soodo gorsa weli bogi duuchchi bagee'na konne gola'leeke gedhebiinxe orda'n fixeenso'ole, haasottetteshshan Isira'eelii'i anjirona'a ane'e fildettexxa tenneni kokeessannon.» <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Isi hiyyeeshshan isi'a kadde; Gedewooni gorsa soodimaro ke'e wodda golalooxxa orda gedhechchixxa miicaa wodda mitte qore wo'meeki wodi'i giddii'n fule. <verse eid="JDG 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Gedewoon Mageno, «Ballo ane'n mufattoxxe'e; mitte qortuma atee qoro; golalooxxe orda'n wele yaane hunjona'a amo seera ani'a uwwi; eettene yanna'n golalooxxi orda bagge'na qarqarake'n hedheek bogi duuchchi lashshi hiyyaashsha ani'a assi» hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Eettene hashsha Mageni ookkoneen beessisa asse; bogi duuchchi fixeesik lashshi hiyya wodda, golalooxxi orda kinni bagonxemman.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s1">Gedewoon Midiyaamika Manna Injifateexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Gorsa boro haachabbee'na Yiruba'aali hiyyemeek Gedewooninna hordofeeyye isixxi gorsa bariisa ke'neexxi Haaroodixxe muummeba qecence. Midiyaamitotixxi baxxe insa'neexxe baxxenaa'n middi darre'n Moorexxe kooba bira dhooqa giddo hexxemman.<verse eid="JDG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Gedewoonii'i hiyyee qici: «Midiyaamitotixxe anga'n insa'neexxe'n sa'isse uwwabe'noshsha atinni welt hedheek manni heddoken; Isira'eeli ifixxi hunna isee anjirte'eeshsha hedati ifi dukkabaashsha, <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />‹Ha'no giddii'n godoba gureek manji hedheexxe kaddoole Gele'adixxe koobanaa'n ille iima higowwaal› hitetexxi konne arda'n lalab» tenne buuton lame tommena lammi kumi manni hingee'na tommi kumi gate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:8">Lew. 20:8</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Konneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Gedewoonii'i hiyyee qici: «Ta'ana heddo sannachcha affeetten; insa'ne'e gaalaniinbaa aaxxe sa'i; ookko ani insa'nee hega uudannon; atixxa duuka me'annon hiyyaak manji hedheexxe kaddole me'uun; marabe'non hiyyaak hedhoole kinni higuun.» <verse eid="JDG 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Gedewooninna arda galaaninba'a adhdhe me'e; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna isoo «Gulufate wode'e wonshiinsha arraaphpha'n ha'waaka duuchcha ayyumma uude insa'nee foyi!» hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Angat wode'e oobesa'n ha'waake manniki laakkoossi sase dhibba geye: gateek manni duuchchi kinni guluffate ha'weemman. <verse eid="JDG 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Gedewoonii'i «Angat wode'e oobesa'n ha'weeke konne sase dhibba mannixxe buuton ha'noo anjirannon: Midiyaamika manna loldine injifattinaashsha midditte ha'no'a uwwannon; gateek kinn dage dagemanbaa higaashsha kuli» hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Tennexxee Gedewoon ardiinxa itanna suusu'luwwa adhemak sase dhibba manna malee wele Isira'eelika manni duuchchi ifi ifike duunkaanibaa hingaashsha asse; tinni duuchcha kadda wodda Midiyaamitotixxi kaambe insa'ne aadi darre wolo'oti giddo hexxemman.<verse eid="JDG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Eettene gorsa Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Gedewonii'i hiyyee qici «Insa'nee lolde injiffattattoshsha anga atixxe'n sa'isse uwwannon marte loli. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Ati eettene kaambe lolatee sodaattottole kinni Puura hiyyemaake atike erganjinni welti adadde'a dirri; <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />insa'ne hinaaxxanna laqqi; ookkoneechchi muduma insa'ne'n lola ke'issate'e hunna alfitatton;» Tennexxee Gedewooni ifika erganjo Puuranni welti naaphi hedheebaa adaadde marre. <verse eid="JDG 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />Laakkossi insa'nek koro'miisiinke haaganiinsha hexxeemmaxxi Midiyaamito, Amaaleeqitonna miidik manni dhooqa giddo bukki hiyyeemman; insa'neke gaaluwwik laakkossinna laakko'emmammabaake abbaayyatike maanchishatemman.<verse eid="JDG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Gedewoon ookko geyeeshshann mitti manjichch oojjoteexxa oojjo ifike jaaloke'n haaso'a'na laqe: iitti oojjotinna «Mitte so'iinxi kebbo iimi'n goggo'mita'n dagge'e Midiyaamike mannixxe kaanbe'n hedheeke duunkaani hana ibbeexxi ookkonee duunkaana kandaa wodda ganetixxe hunnaxxe birasa'nenaa'n kexeexxa iikki dunkaani fottoqe digemee'naa uudenne.»<verse eid="JDG 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Iikki jaali isikinna, «Tinni Isira'eelichcho Iyyo'aasika belto Gedewoonike wolaantichcha malee'e wele yaanebaan; Kunse Mageni Gedewoonixxe anga'n Midiyaamika mannanna sannachcha isika duuchcha sa'isse uwwe'en» hiyye hiise haaso'e.<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Gedewooni eettene oojjonna tika isexxa laqeexxi guluffate Mageno sagade; ookonechchi uduma Isira'eelike ardiba higeexxi insa'nee «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Midiyaamika mannanna sannachcha insa'neeka anga ha'nooxxe'n sa'isse uwwammaxxe ke'we!» hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Sase dhibba manna saseba foyeexxi mitti mittinge manjo'n suusu'lenna giddo xassa afeexxa mitte odolcho uwwe. <verse eid="JDG 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Gedewooninna insa'nee hiyyee qici «Ani kaanbe eetteneba mare geyeenexxi assaannexxa ha'no hubattine uuddineexxi iseenni asse. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Aninna aninni welt hedheek duuchchi malagatuwa ufuunfanno wodda ha'nonna baxxe ha'nooxxe'n malagata ufuuffina'n ‹Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'anna Gedewooni'a!› hitine raarre.»<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Heqanjuwwi jijjiiremee'naa hashsha wodhakiinxi heqqa saffemma wodda Gedewooninna isin welti hedheemmak dhibbi manni eettene kaambe qarqar genne; insa'nenna ifi ifika malagatakanna ufuunfe; anga angate'n anfeemmaxxa odowwanna shinne. <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Weleba hexxemmaxxi lame gamo tenneen assite; duuchchiingi ookkone xassuwwa bita'ixxe anga'n, suusu'letanna middixxe anga'n abixineexxi «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti'anna Gedewooni'a lollaannen!» hina'n raarre. <verse eid="JDG 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Mitti mittingi manji eettene kaambe qarqara'n isi'a dhaabemmaxxe bakka'n uurre wodda duuchchiing Midiyaamik sannachchi raara'n baaje. <verse eid="JDG 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Sasi dhibbi Gedewoonik manni suusu'le ufunfaa wodda Duuchchi Woddik Gootti mitti mittingi naaphiink sannachchuwi ifi ifike jaalo'ni wolaantichchik ke'ashsha asse; iikki sannachchi kinna udumi'a Tsiireera'a wirri hiyye higeexxi Beetishiixxa, ookko'ni sa'eexxi Xabaati bira hedheeke Abeeli Mehoolaxxe gabala qico'n ke'ne baanje.<verse eid="JDG 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Konneechchi uduma Nefitaalemik, Aseerikenna Minaasek mini hado duuchcha ye'nee'naa insa'nena fulleexxi Midiyaamika manna shorrine <verse eid="JDG 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Gedewooninna koobatike Eefireemike boga'n hedheeke manna duuchcha'n «Fuldineexxi Midiyaamika manna lolle; Midiyaamik manni foofe angii'n fulche'nabaashsha Yordaanoosika galaananna wele yaasu wode'e Beetibaara qico'n hedheeka heqqe» hiyye. Tennexxee Efireemiki mann duuchcha ye'ne; Yordanosika galaanana ookko'a yaa'a'neka wele wode'e Beetebara qico'n abinde. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />Hereebinna Zeebi hiyyemaak lame Midiyaamike mannik akeekisanjuwwa boojiine; Hereebii'i Hereebixxe rassa qarqara iittanni Ze'ebininiinna Ze'ebike woyine miicatixxe bakka hanna insa'nee shinne. Ookkoneechchi uduma gateeka Midiyaamika manna shorrine; Oreebikanna Ze'ebenika gooba kunteexxi Gedewooni hedheeba'a Yordaanoosi'a aa'ne dange.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s1">Gedewoonixxa Injiffachchonna Halo Fulaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Ookkonneechchchi uduma Efireemik manni Gedewoonii'i «Midiyaamito loldotaa martette wodda mayee no'o ye'a gophette? Mayee iitta hexxeexxa yaane no'o'ni assitette?» hineexxi lumooshsha isoo aallante.<verse eid="JDG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Isinna hiisseexxi «Ani assennexxee'n ha'no assitinneexxi saxxabaata? Efireemixxe woyinetixxi feshile mayete'n bukki hiteexxi aageexxe Abi'eezerixxe woyinenaa'n caldabaata? <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />Mageni Midiyaamike mannika akeekisanjuwwa Oreebiinna Ze'ebi'i shiltine injifattinaashsha anga ha'nooxxe'n sa'isse'e uwwe'en; ha'no assitinemmaxxenni wel fakkataaxxi ani assa dande'annaxxi maachchommata?» Isinna tennee haaso'ee wodda mufe insa'nexxi hashshibbi hite.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Eettene yanna'ni Gedewooninna isik sasi dhibbi manni Yordaanoosike galaanika foonfe; gonphe midde hexxoolenna naapha ifika shorrina'nemman. <verse eid="JDG 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Sukooti genneeshshan Gedewoon qachchi giddike manna'n hiyyee qici, «Midiyaamik moyanji Zebahinna Silimanaa'a shorrate'n hana hedheennaxxee anik manni yo'oshsha gophe'eni rakkine indaachcho insa'ne uwwe» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:11">Far. 83:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Sukootik sooreessuwwi kinni «Atike sannachchi'a ita mayeete uunaannok? Zebahinninna Silimanaa'a haano boojitettexxeeteta» hine.<verse eid="JDG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Gedewooninna «Eloxxen! Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Zebahininna Silimanaa'a anga anxe'n sa'ise uwwaxxe yanna'n qiilla gammooje'n utetinna qu'muudoti ha'noo amaaxxannon!» hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Gedewooninna Phini'eeli'a mareexxi ookko hedha'neeka manna ookkoneenni qortuma qore; yaane kinni Phini'eelik manninna Sukootik manni hiissemmanga woldinga hiissichcho hiissine iso'n kulle. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Insa'nenna Phini'eelika manna «Lole injifate'e nage'ik higanno wodda qachcha ha'noka heqqatixxa xellephpho diigannon» hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Eettene yanna Zebahelinna Silimana tommenna onde kuma kadaake ifi ifike sannachchinni welti Qerqeri hiyyendaaxxe bakka'n he'nemman; kunninna borotike ardikenna loli giddo reyeemake dhibbanna lame tomme kuma wolaantichcha ka'leeke sannachchanaa'n gateekemman. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Tennexxee Gedewoon qiilla gammoojjeka ori darree'n Nobahikenna Yogibehake dhidhim darree'n sa'eexxi naaphiinka sannachchi keekatebaang fenxe hiyyate'n hedhee'na'a isoo lole. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Lami Midiyaamik moyanjuwwi Zabahelinna Silimana baanje; yaane kinni Gedewon shorre insa'ne abide; sannachchuwi insa'neek duuchchinna alayik henkekki hiyyaashsha asse.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Iyyo'aasik belti Gedewooni Hereesixxe kooba darree'n lolakenaa'n illee iima hige. <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />Isinna Sukootike mannanaa'n mitte dargaggeessa booji'eexxi isoo qore; iikki dargaggeessinna Sukootika torbaane tommenna torbaane sooreessuwwikanna geedheka summa isi'a borreesse. <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Gedewooni Sukootike mannibaa dageexxi insa'nee « ‹Zebahelinna Silimanaa'a boji'itebexxon; mayeeteta ta'a solo'we gaggabeeke atike sannachchi'a ita uunnaanneki?› hitineexxi ane'n gacifatine'eemman. Ta'a kinni Zebahelinna Silimani kunse anxe anga'n ibbe'een!» Hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Ookkoneechchi uduma utenna qu'muudo gammoojje'n aadheexxi Sukootike qachchika sooreessuwa gane. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Phini'eeli hexxeexxa qachchiinxe heqqaxxa kinjiinxa xelleephpho diige; ookkone qachchi giddo hedheeka labbalo duuchchanna shiye.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Gedewoon «Taaboori shiltineemmak manni hitta dhekemma?» Hiyye Zebahelinna Silimanaa'a qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 8:18">Insa'nena iso'n «Atee fakkanta'nemman; mitti mitting moyanjinke belto fakkaataamman» hine.<verse eid="JDG 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Gedewooninna insa'ne'n «Insa'ne anxe amaxxe oosexxe dayyuwwamman; sila ha'no insa'nee shiya waldineele aninna ha'noo geyabe'noxxa Duuchchi Woddik Goottik Summinni kakataannen» hiyye hiise haaso'e. <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Ookkoneechchi uduma angafa belto ifika Yeterii'i «Ta'a tennee insa'nee shiyi!» Hiyye ajaje. Yeteri kinn oosete kadeemmaxxee godoba gure wolaantichcha fulchedhebaan.<verse eid="JDG 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Zebahelinna Silimana Gedewoonii'i «Manjixi hunna isike bisixxe qixxe'nite kaddemmaxxee mo yoona atinni no'o shiyi» hine; tennexxee Gedewoon insa'nee shiyeexxi insa'neke gaaluwwike gooba'n hedhemmaka seessuwwa duuchcha aadhe.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eelik ardi Gedewoonii'i, «Ati Midiyaamike mannixxe anganaa'n no'o gargaartetaxxe atinna ati uduma oose atixxi iittan atixxe oosexxi oose no'o mootondine galche» hine.<verse eid="JDG 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Gedewooninna insa'ne'n «Aninna oose anxinna ha'no mootome galchinabe'non; ha'no mootomma galchaak umi isinginnin Duuchchi Woddike Goottan» hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />Isima'eelik manni manshatika worqeti gutichcha uggudha aada insa'nexxe kaddeemmaxxee Gedewoonk sannachchinna insa'neka gutichchuwwa boojineemman; Gedewooninna «Mitti mittingi boojitinemmaka gutichcha hinnuwwe ane'n» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Isira'eelik ardinna «Gammadik uunannon» hiye. Hirba ookkone'n seemma fannee'naa boojjinemmake manshatika gutichchinaa'n mitti mittingi hana ibse. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Gedewooni aadhemak iikki worqetik mashatixxi gutichchuwwi lame tomme kiilo kade; kuninna wele seesuwwa, goobinka seesanna Midiyaamitotik moyanjuwwi oddo'wamaxxa baddeessitte seemma, iittanni ifi ifike gaaluwwike gooba'n hedheemmake seesuwwi gadhi darre. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Gedewooninna eettene worqen magenooffachchotixxa fakkuwwa giisseexxi ilememmake qachcha Ofira giddo ugge; Isira'eelik ardi duuchchi Efuude magenoofatati yabaabulemmaxxee iitti Efuude Gedewooni'anna isike mine hadi'a gufote kade.<verse eid="JDG 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Konne qicin Isira'eelito Midiyaamito injifate; langaxxanna ifi lumminseban; Gedewoon lubbo hedheemma qico'n shoole tomme wogga duuchcha ookkone bogake'n nage'i leelle.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gedewoonixxa Reyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Iyyo'aasik belti Yiruba'aali ifike minibaa me'eexxi ookko ofo'le. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Isi heddo melaalle aadhemmaxxee torbaane labbaxxa oose afeemman. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Sekemike boga'n hexxammaxxi gursumeecho labbaka isi'a ilde; isika summakanna Abemelek hiyye fulche. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Iyyo'aasik belti Gedewoon cime reye; ifike anike Iyyo'aasik hirreessiba moogeme; kunni hirreessinna Abi'eezerixxe sanneke qachcha'n Ofira hiyyemaaba afeemmaan.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />Gedewoon reyeexxi lumo qico turebaangi Isira'eelik ardi Ba'aalii'i magenoonfatati yabaabule; Ba'aaliberiitimi'a sagande. <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />Isira'eeliki ardi qarqarake'n hedhemmak naaphuwwa duuchchanaa'n gargaareeka Duuchchi Woddika Gootta ifika Mageno qalli hineba'a. <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />Iittanni Yiruba'aali hiyyemeek Gedewooni Isira'eeli'a assemmaxxa eloxxa yaane duuchcha qaabbata gophatenaa'n kexxeexxa isike mini hadi'a galata hiissinaake kandeba'a.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s1">Abeemeeleekii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Yiruba'aalik belti Abemelek isixxe amatik hadi hedheeba Sekemike qachchiba mareexxi amatike hado duuchcha'n hiyyee qici: <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />«Sekemike manna duuchcha'n hitine qortinaa qici: ‹Iitti torbaane tomme Yiruba'aalixxi oose mo'o, yookaan mitti manji calli ha'no galcheexxa woyya?› Ani kinni ha'noke maalanna mico kadennexxa qaabatte.» <verse eid="JDG 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Amatik hadinna isixxe tukke kade'e tenneenn Sekemik manna'n kulle; Sekemik mannina «Isi dayyo no'oken» hina'n Abemelekii'i hordofatee hede. <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />Ba'aaliberitike mini hadinaa'n torbaane tomme sibiljo birre aa'ne iso'n uune; Abemelekinna eetten torbane tomme sibiljo biren bokkaametanna baashe manna hire; insa'nenna isoo hordonfe. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />Ifike anike minibaa Ofira'a mareexxi eettene torbaane tomme Yiruba'aalixxa oose ifika dayyuwwa mitte kinji hana gorra'e; Gedewoonik maa'nichchi belti Iyyo'ataami kinni sho'omemmaxxe gate. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Sekemikinna Betimilok ardi duuchchi Abemelekii'i moosinso'a Sekemi giddo eettene sooddo qarqara hedheeke qilxiinke haqichchi birra bukki hine.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Iyyo'ataami tennee laqe wodda Gerizaanixxe koobaxxe xungo'n fuleexxi hafuura gikki asse hiyyee qic, «Ha'no Sekemike mannaa! Ani hiyyanexxa laqqina'noole Magenikinna ha'nooxxa laqaan. <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Barratixxa barra haqqe bukki hite ifi'n moyanjo moosinsino'a fulde; ejersiinka haqichchonna ‹Ati no'o moyi› hite.<verse eid="JDG 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />«Ejersiink haqichchinna ‹dharicha magenuwi'anna mannakee la'otee kaddeexxa zayite uwwannaxxa waale haqqichchuwwa'n moyonnaa marano?› Hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />«Ookkoneechchi uduma iikki haqqichchuwwi balaseti haqichcho ‹daggettexxi no'o'n moyi› Hine.<verse eid="JDG 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />«Balaseti haqichchi kinn ‹anxa xe'menna eloxxa gummisannaxxa gumma waale haqqichchuwwake'n moyona'a marano?› Hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />«Tennexxee iikki haqqichchuwwi woyinetka hiddichcho ‹daggettexxi no'o'n moyi› hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />«Iikki woyinetik hiddichchinna kinni ‹dharichcha magenuwwanna manna gammachiisaaxxa anxa woyinetixxa booka waalennexxi haqqichchuwwake'n moyonaa marano?› Hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />«Tennexxee iikki haqqichchuwwi duuchchi qosorotixxa ute ‹daggeettexxi no'o moyi› hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />«Iitti qosorotixxi utenna ookkonee haqqichchuwwa, ‹Anee moyanjo assitino'a heddino'oole daggineexxi gaaddisi anki hunda gollatte; tennee assa gophphino'oole kinni giira qosorotixxe utenaa'n giira fuldeexxi Libaanoosika haqqichchuwwanna ittowaal› hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />«Yoonna Abemelekii'i moosisine'eek qajeelummatanna dhugaa'a assatite kaddoole Yiruba'aalinna isika mini hado eeloxxenni uddineexxi isi asseexxe isi'a hasissaaxxa assitineexxe kaddo'oole. <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />Anki anni ha'nooxxee loleexxanna ha'noo Midiyaamitotixxe anganaa'n gatiso'a ifixxa hedho uwweexxa heddine'een hiyyaten. <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />Techcho kinni ha'no anke annike mini hado'n elobaaxxenn kexxineexxi isixxa torbaane tomme oose mitte kinji hana shiltineen; ha'noke fira kad'emmaxxee anki anni ifixxe garbittenaa'n i'leemmaka Abemelekii'i Sekemik moyanjo asseexxineeni. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Yoona techcho Yiruba'aali'anna isike mini hadi'a assitinexxi dhugaatitenna qajeelummatite kaddoole Abemelekinn welti gammadde; isinna ha'non welt gammadowwaal! <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Tinni kada gophphoole kinni Abemelekinaa'n kexxeexxi giira ha'noo Sekemikanna Beetimiloonika manna ittowwaal: iittann Sekemii'inna Betimiloonike mannanaa'ni giira kexxe Abemeleki'i ittowwaal.»<verse eid="JDG 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Iyyo'ataami tennee haaso'eechchi uduma dayyo ifika Abemelekii'i sodatemmaxxee baqateexxi Bi'eer mare ookko ofo'le.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abemelekinna Seekemika Arda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Abemeleki Isira'eeli'n sase wogga moye: <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Magen Abemeleki'ninna Seekemik mannixxe oddo'n fuggichcha hafuura erge; tennexxee Sekemik manni iso'n fuggoxxin ke'e. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Mageni tenne asseechchi eettenne Yiruba'aalixxe torbaane tomme oose'n assendeexxe xaqarotixxe hujexxeenna dundeemmaxxe insa'nexxe mundeexxee dayyi insa'nek Abemelek dayyuwwa ifika shiyaashsha isoo gargareeke Sekemike manna'n halo fulateeten. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Sekemik manni Abemeleki'n naaphuummat ke'eexxi heenooka manna filati koobuwwatixxe xungo'n sho'eme gadaaka manna uggine; iikki manni ora ookkone sa'ammake manna duuchchanaa'n mulqedhe; Abemelekinna tennee duuchcha laqe.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Abedik belti Ga'aali ifik dayyuwwinn welti Sekemi'a dage; Seekemik manninna godobi mittin isoo addate. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Duuchchiing ifike woyinetke hiddichchuwwik fichchibaa marreexxi gumma qoce'ne; woyinetixxa bookanna giisineexxi ba'la qicinn ayyaana ulfeessine; ifike magenuwwike galmi giddo e'yineexxi ookko inde ha'wina'n Abemelekii'i yowwine. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Abedik belti Ga'aalinna hiyyee qici: «Abemelek ayyeete? No'o Sekemik manni isi'a hiremmaanek mayeete? Isi Yiruba'aalike beltobaata? Zeburi, Hamoorika anna Sekemii'i eggatemammmakebaata? Seekemika anna Emoorike manni'a hiremme; Mayee isi'a ajajjemmanno? Tenne mannii'n ha'noxxe gosaxxe booso kadeeke Sekemike anni'a, Hamoori'a xuurameeyyete kadde. <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Konnee arda akeekaannek ante kaduunnadu! Iikki woddi Abemelekii'i ookko'n fulchannan; higgeen iso'n ‹Sannachcha atika jabeessexxe fulde loli!› Hiyye kulannan.»<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Ookkone qachcha galchammak Zebuli, Abedik belti Ga'aalika haaso'a laqe yo'oshsha aare. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Abemelekibaa sho'ik erganjuwwa hiyye ergee qic, «Abedik belti Ga'aali ifike dayyuwwinn welti Sekemi'a dage'een; ate'n ookkone qachchika manna elobaaxxenn ke'isine'een. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Yoona atinna atinni hedhemmak ardi hashshanni ookkoo'n kexxine diidi giddo riphphine gaade. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Soodo gorsa arishsho fuldaa wodda kexxineexxi ookkone qachcha'n kino darbitina'n lola ke'isse; Ga'aalinna isinni hedhemmak manni ha'noo lolo'a dagaa wodda dandeetinee qico ijaba qicinni insa'nee ganne.»<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Tennexxee Abemelekinna isinni hedhemmak manni duuchchi hashshanni ke'e fule; Sekemike qarqara'ninna shooleba qoodemeexxi riphe gaade. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Abedik belti Ga'aali ookkone qachchinaa'n fuleexxi eettene e'yatixxe hula'n uurre wodda Abemelekinna isinni hedhemmak ardi ripheexxi gaadammabaa'n fule.<verse eid="JDG 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Ga'aalinna insa'nee afeexxi Zebuli'i, «Uuda! Eettene koobaxxe xungonaa'n ardi dirrate'n hedheen!» Hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 9:36">Zebulinna, «Koobatik gaadisi manjoke fakkatee'naa haakeeten» hiyye hiise haaso'e.<verse eid="JDG 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Higgeenni Ga'aali, «Uudabexxoo! Ardiqa eettene koobaxxe oddonaa'n addadde dagate'n hedheen; mitte kuta gojaalleyyetike qilxi daree'n dagate'n hexxeen!» Hiyyeexxi haaso'e.<verse eid="JDG 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Zebuli hiyyee qic: «Iitti atixxi onno'a duuchcha ta'a haba martee gelte? ‹Abemeleki hiyyemaake manjichchi'a isi'a ergatemaannek mayeete?› Hita'n qorta'ettak atetemmabaata? Iikki tuffatte'eetak manni konneten, kexxe marte insa'nee loli.»<verse eid="JDG 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Ga'aali Sekemika arda akeeka'n fule Abemeleki lole; <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />kaddo malee'e Abemelek isoo shorre; qachchiike ookkone dalla'iinke cufani qico'n hedheeke ora'n banjaa wodda heddi manni mado'e ibe. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Abemelekinna Aruuma ofo'le; Zebuli Ga'aalinna dayyuwwa isika Sekemii'ni shorre fulche.<verse eid="JDG 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Langa baro Seekemik ardi fichchi giddi'a me'eexxa Abemeleki'n kulende. <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />Isinna ifika manna adhdheexxi fule; ookkoneechchi uduma konne manna saseba qoodeexxi ookkone fichchuwwi qiddo rinphe gandaashsha asse. Sekemi manni ookkone qachchinaa'n fulaa wodda afeexxi riphe gaadamabaa'n insa'nee shiyo'a fule. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Abemelekinna isinn welti hexxemmaxxi kutuwwa bakka abixxatee wiinamik ookkone qachchixxe hulabaa gongitaammaxxa yanna wele gatteexxi lame kuttuwwa iittanni gongita'n marteexxi ookkone fichcha'n hedheemmaka manna birte. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />Eettene barra Abemelek barra duuchcha ookkone qachcha lola'n hoseexxi abixxe; giddo hedheemmaka arda bire; ookkonee qachchakanna diigeexxi isi hana maxine facaase.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Sekemike kinjiinke dalla'i giddo hedhemmak manni tennee laqeexxi Elberitike magenooffachchotike galmi giddo hexxeexxe kollo giddo e'ye. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Abemelekinna insa'nee Sekemi bukki hineexxa laqe. <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />Isinna isik manni duuchchi Tsalimoonixxe kooba qabate; Abemelekinna qoce aadhdheexxi heenoxxe haqichchiinxa dame woxeexxi dugummote'n duke; isinni hedheemmaka mannanna, «Rakke! Ani assa'naa uuddinemmaxxa asse» hiyya'n ajaaje. <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Ardi iikki duuchchinna damuwwa woxeexxi Abemelekii'i hordofe; eettene damuwwanna eettene kollote'n irkinse tuuleexxi manni giddo hedheemmashanni hedhee'naa giirati insa'nee gunbe; tennexxee Sekemike kinjiinke dalla'i giddo hedhemmak mitte kuma geyaak meyya labbak manni reye.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Abemelek Tebesike qachchibaa mareexxi isoonna buqe abide. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Kaddo malee'e ookkone qachchi giddo kinjiixxi qeerrixxi jabaxxi xellephpho hexxemmaxxee ookkonee qachchik ardi duuchchi meyya labbake hiyyemebaang ookko'a baaje; eettenee hulanna giddii'n cufe'neexxi eettene xelleephphoxxe heellichcho hana da'mine. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Abemelek loleexxi eettene kinjiinxa xelleephpho abide; giiratinna isee gubo'a isexxe hulaba geyeeshshanni, <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" />mitte manjichcho iimi'n damiinka suusuqanjo isi umoke'n wocci assiteexxi isike umika qoonjo butuchchite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 11:21">2 Sam. 11:21</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 9:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Isinna wiinamik loliinka isika miya ba'edhammak ye'eexxi « ‹Meyaxxe shilteen hinabaashsha maganneten wolaantichcha atika luqisse anee shiyi.› » Hiyye ajaje. Tennexxee isik erganjinna isoo ote'naa isinna reye. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Isira'eelik ardi Abemelek reyeexxa calla uudeexxi duchchiing ifi ifike minbaa me'e.<verse eid="JDG 9:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Konne qicin Abemelek torbaane tomme ifika dayyuwwa shiyati ana ifike'n asseexxe fuggo'a Mageni isixxe hujeka hira isi'a uwwe. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Iittanni Magen Sekemike mannixxa fuggo duuchcha insa'ne'ninni wirri asse; konne qicinni Yirube'aalika belto Iyyo'ataamixxi badino insa'ne'n gelte.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s1">Tola'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Abemeleki reyeechchi uduma Duudik belti Foohok belti Tola Isira'eelii'i wodo'a ke'e: isinna Yisakoorike gosati mininaa'nite kadaa wodda hedhaamabi koobatike Efireemike boga'n Saamiri hiyyemaake booncho'n hedhaamman: <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Kunni manjichchi Isira'eelike sooreessa kade lame tommenna sase wogga tureechchi uduma lummedhe: isinna Saamiri moogeme.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ya'iiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Toola'ni itti aane Gele'adichchi Ya'iiri fileme: Isinna lame tommenna lame wogga Isira'eeli'ni mure. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />Sase tomme Harre gulufaaxxa sase tomme labbaxxi oose afeeman; isixxi labbaxxi oosenna telchi qico'ni Ya'iirixxe baxxe hiyyende ye'endaaxxe sase tomme qacchcha Gele'adike boga'ni anfeeman. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Ya'iirinna reye; Qaamooni giddonna moogeme.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Isira'eelik ardi higgeen Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'ni fuggoxxa huje hujje; insa'nenna Ba'aalinna Asitaarooti'i iittanni Sooyiyaka, Sidoonaka, Mo'aabika, Amoonitotikanna Filisixeemitotixxa fakkuwwa magenoonfante. Isira'eelik ardi Duuchchi Woddika Gootta waalemaxxenna isi'a ergatema gonpheemmaxxe'e; <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />isinna Isira'eeli'ni mufateexxi Filisixeemikenna Amoonike mannixxe anga'ni sa'isse uwwe. <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />Amoonitonnaa Filisixxeemito Yordaanoosik galaan wido Amoorike boga'ni Gele'adi giddo hedha'neka Isira'eelika arda tommenna saddeeta wogga wixixxi assine galchine. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Amoonito Yihudaka, Biiniyaamikanna Efireemika mini mini hado lollo'aa Yordaanoosika galaana foonfe; Isira'eelik ardinna yo'oshsha wixixxi hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eelik ardi «Ate'e Duuchchi Woddika Gootta no'oka Mageno waale Ba'aali hinaaka dharichcha magenuwwa hordonfenxi no'oo atee'e balleesineenen» hine Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa oo'ne.<verse eid="JDG 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyyee qici, «Gibtsek, Amoorik, Amoonik, Filisixeemik, <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />Sidoonito, Amaaleeqikenna Ma'oonik ardinna insa'bee'e rakinse; ha'noo'o gargaaaronaa'a anibaa'a raartinene; eega ani insa'nexxe anganaa'ni ha'noo'o anjireemabaa? <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Ha'no kinni anee waaldine wele dharichcha magenuwwa magenoonfatine'en; tennexxee ani ha'no'o langaxxa anjirabo'non. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Ha'noonna martine fi'litineeke dharichcha magenuwwa'n oodhdhe; rakko ha'noo'n gelta woddanna isi ha'noo anjirowwaali!»<verse eid="JDG 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Isira'eelk ardi Duuchchi Woddika Gootta «No'o cubbo hunjeenen eloxxe labbee'e ate'ni leelliteexxa no'o assi; ballo maganne telchinxa calla no'o anjiri.» <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Oookkoneechchi uduma insa'nexxe oddo'ni hedheeka dharichcha magenuwwa ifinaa'ni fugusine insa'nenna Duuchchi Woddika Gootta magenoonfante. Isinna Isira'eeli lumoxxe rakko giddo hexxee'naa sammi hiyye uuda dande'eebaan.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Ookkoonneechchi uduma Amoonik manni lolakee'e qophpheefate'e Gele'adi giddo bukki hiyyeemma wodda; Isira'eelitonna iittanni bukki hiteexxi Mitsipha hiyyemaaba kaanbe gisexxe qeccecce. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Gele'adike ardik soorsuwwinna weli'aan weli «Amoonitote'n lola safaaki manji Gelaadi hedha'neeke manna duuchcha'ni sooreessa kadaani.»<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Gele'adichchi Yoftaahe janna loliinke manjomman; isik anninna Gele'aditemman; isixxi ammanna yabaabultotemman. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Iittanni Gele'adixxi are Gele'aadi'a labbaxxi oose ilde'ee. Insa'nenna nophphiineexxi Yoftaahee, «Ati wele amanaa'ni ilendeettaxxee'e no'oke mini hidinaa'n qadaada affeeboxxen» hine isoo shorrine. <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Tennexxee Yoftaahe ifike dayyuwwanaa'n baaje'e Xoobi hiyyemaake boga'ni ofo'le; ookkonna baashe bukki hiteexxi duuka isixxa me'ite.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Heenoxxe yanna uduma Amoonito Isira'eeli'n lola ke'issitee wodda, <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />iikki Gele'adik sooreessuwwi Yoftahee iyyedgatee Xoobike bogibaa me'ite. <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />Insa'nenna Yoftaahee, «Amoonitoti welti lola inbonnaa'a dageteexxi no'oo akeeki» hine.<verse eid="JDG 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Yoftaahenna insa'ne'n, «Anee gibbineexxi anke annike mininaa'ni shorritineemmabataa? Ta'ata rakko ha'noo'n geltammale anee hassinaa?» Hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Gele'adik sooreessuwwinna Yoftaahee, «Yoona no'o ta'a atibaa dangeennen; Amoonito lollonaa'a ke'i welti me'inno; Gelaadi giddo ha'naanneke no'oo duuchchingike ati sooreessa kaddatton.»<verse eid="JDG 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Yoftaahenna Geli'adinika akeekisanjuwwa hiissexxi, «Amoonito lolonaa anke bogibaa anee hiisitinoolenna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti insa'ne anga anxe'ni sa'isse uwweele ani dhugaandinn ha'nooke sooreessa kadannoo?» hiyye insa'nee qore.<verse eid="JDG 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Gele'adik sooreessuwwinna «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti dhugaa kula no'oxxen; hitettexxa duuchcha dhugaaten assinannon» hine. <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Tennexxe Yoftaahe Gele'adike sooreessuwwinni welti me'e; iikki ardikinna isoo ifike sooreessanna ajajjallo assedhe; Yoftahenna ookkonee haase'eemmaka hiyychcho duuchcha Mitsipha Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo lebe haaso'e.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yoftaahe Amoonitotika moyanjo'n, «Atinni maa lola afee'naate boga anka dagge loldettek?» Hiyyati erganjuwwa erge.<verse eid="JDG 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Amoonitotik moyanji Yoftaaheke erganjuwwa'n, «Tennee assennechchi Isira'eelik ardi Gibtsee'n fulle wodda Aaroonikenna Yaaboqike galaanuwwixxe oddo hedheekanna Yordaanoosika galaana qico'n hedheeka anka boga adhdhineemmaxxeeten; ta'anna nage'inginni ani'a hiisse» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Yoftaahenna ookkonee erganjuwwa higgeenni Amoonitotike moyanjibaa ergeexxi, <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />hiyyee qici:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="JDG 11:15">«Yoftaahe hiyya'nee qici: Isira'eelik ardi Mo'aabikanna kadi Amoonitotika boga adhdhe'ebaan. <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Isira'eelik ardi Gibtsee'n fullee wodda qiilla gammoojje darree'n Diimmoxxe Abbaayyabaa ookkoo'ninna Qaadeesi'a me'e. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" />Isira'eelik ardinna Eedoomike moyanjo, ‹Atike bogi giddii'n sa'nonna'a maganneten eettii no'aa uwwi› hiyyati erganjuwwa isibaa erge; Edoomik moyanji kinni isi hiyyeexxa laqeba'a. Mo'aabike moyanjibaanna iittanni erge; isinna isi'a eetti uwwebaan. Tennexxee Isira'eelik ardi Qaadeesi ofo'le.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:14-21">Lak. 20:14-21</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />«Ookkoneechchi uduma Eedoomikanna Mo'aabika boga dooneexxi, eettene qiilla gamoojje giddo me'ati Mo'abii'n boroti darre'n dangeexxi Arinoonike galaani wido kaambe oltine. Mo'aabixxi gabala Arnoonike galaana kadeemmaxxee Mo'aabixxe gabalabaa e'yinebaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:4">Lak. 21:4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />«Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eelik ardi Haseebon hedheeke Amooritotika moyanjo Siihoonibaa erganjuwwa ergeexxi, ‹No'o ifike bogibaa me'innonnaa atik bogi giddii'n sa'nonnaa eetti no'aa uwwi› hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Siihooni kinni Isira'eelik ardi isixxe galcha giddii'n sa'o'aa eetti uwwatee Isira'eelika arda addatebaan; isinna ifika sannachcha bukki asseexxi Yahaatsi'n kaambe olteechchi uduma Isira'eelika arda lole.<verse eid="JDG 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />«Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelik Magen Siihooninna isika arda duuchcha Isira'eelixxe anga'ni sa'isse uwwe. Insa'nenna injifante Isira'eelinna ookkone boga'ni hedha'neeka Amooritotika boga duuchha ifi'ni hiisedhe. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Aroononike galananaa'n Yaaboqike galaan qico'n eettene qiilla gammoojjenaa'n Yordaanoosike galaan qico'n hedheeka Amooritotika boga duuchcha abixxine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-24">Lak. 21:21-24</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />«Tennexxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelik Mageni Amoorito arda ifike, Isira'eeli edii'n shorreexxi fulchee uduma ati ookkone boga adhdhittotaateeta? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />Magen atik Kemooshi ati'a uwweeka adhdhite sammite ofo'ldabexxoo? No'o kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'ok Mageni no'o'a uwweeka qadaada duuchcha dhaallanon. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" />Ati Mo'aabika moyanjo Sefoorika belto Baalaqi saxxattota? Isi Isira'eelinni lolemeemata? Yookaan loleemata?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-6">Lak. 22:1-6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Isira'eeli Haseeboninna qarqara iseke'n hedhemmake olla'uwwan, Aro'erininna iseka loola'uwwa'n, iittann Arinoonike galaani qarqara hedheeka qachchuwwa duuchcha'n sase dhibba wogga ofoleemma wodda mayee eettenne yanna insa'nee adhdhagophineemma'a? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />Ani atee balleessebe'non; atik kinni ane'n duuldeetexxi anee balleesite'eeten; yoonna iikki murte uwwammak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelixxenna Amoonitotixxe oddo'n techcho murowwaal.»<verse eid="JDG 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Amoonik moyanji kinni Yoftaahe ergeexxa era konnee qiconna lummisebaan.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Ookkoneechchi udma Duuchchi Woddike Goottik hafuuri Yoftaahe'n dirrei. Yoftaahenna ke'eexxi Gele'adinna Minaaseke boguwwixxe oddonaa'n sa'eexxi me'e; Gele'adi darre'n hexxeexxi Mitsipha qaxxaamure Amooni'n duule. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Yoftaahenna hiyya'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a wereegee qici, «Amoonito anga anxe'n sa'isite uutotole, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />Amoonito lole injifate ille iima higanonoxxa yanna ediseexxi anee qophedha anke minixxe hulanaa'n fulaak huuni manjinna Duuchchi Woddike Goottike kada; aninna isoo ciincatike tolchi'a shiqisannon.»<verse eid="JDG 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Ookonneechi uduma Yoftaahe Amoonito lolatee fule; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna isoo anga isixxe'n sa'isse uwwe. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Aro'eerinaa'n Miniiti qico'n ookko'ninna Abeeli Kiramiimi qico'n hedheeka lame tomme qachchuwwa balleesse; Amoonitotinna Isira'eeli'a hirende.<verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yofitahexxa Belto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Yoftaahe Mitsipha hedheek ifike minbaa ille iima hige; kunse isixxi belto okole gande sirbita'n isoo qophphpexxo fulde; isenna isi'a mitte belto callamman; ise gadhi darre labbake kadi meyyaxxa affeemmabaan. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Isinna isee uudeexxa yanna yaadoti seemma ifixxa dareexxi «Aanne anxe belto'o anee mancaasete! Waala dande'abe'noka wereega Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a wereegeennaxxee ane'n jabbaxxa rakko iyyedaggette» hiyye yaaddoti oodhe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 30:2">Lak. 30:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Isenna isoo hitee qici: «Anke annaa! Mittele Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a werreegeeten; atik naapha Amoonito ta'a Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ati'a halo fuleemmaxxee werreeggeetaka werreega ane'n muuxi. <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Yaane kinni mitte yaane calla ani'a assitota'a atee kadhataannen; heeruma gophaannaxxee anixxe jaaluwwanni welti koobuwwa'n qabate mammarema'n lame agenjo oodhannoshsha anee geegeessi.»<verse eid="JDG 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Isinna «Kexxe me'i» hiyya'n lame agenji'a me'itaashsha assee; isenna heeruma gophphaammaxxe ifixxe jaaluwwanni koobuwwatibaa mi'ineexxi oo'ne. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Lame agenji uduma ifike annibaa higge; isinna werreegeemmaxxa ise'n asse; isenna dubarichchotemman.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 11:39">Eettene yannanaa'n tinni Isira'eelike arda'n barratendeexxe kaddeexxi <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />Isira'eelik dubarri Gele'adichcho Yoftaahexxa belto hedhati wogga wogga'n fulla'n shoole barra ise'a yaadaan.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yofitaahenna Efireemika Manna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Efireemiki manni hunna ifixxa giisedhe Tsaafonik galaana foofeexxi Yoftaahee, «Ati Amoonito loldotaa fuldatto wodda atinni welti me'inonnaa'a mayee no'o'ni kula gophpheette? Ati giddonni hexxee'naani mine atike'ni giira worrannon.»<verse eid="JDG 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Yoftaahenna insa'ne hiyyee qici, «Aninna anki ardi Amoonike manninn welt jaba qicinni lolemmenne wodda ha'noo qophedhee'naa ha'no insa'neexxe angaa'n anee anjirtinebaan. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Ha'no anee gargaartina'nebaaxxa afennexxi lubbo anxa xe'mifatebe'no shenendinni Amoonito lolatee foofenne; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna anga anxe'n insa'nee sa'isse uwwe. Mayeeteta ha'no anee loldino'aa daggineechchi?» <verse eid="JDG 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Ookkonnechi uduma Yoftaahe Gele'adika manna bukki asseexxi Eefireemike manninni welti loleme; Efiremki manninna, «Ha'no Gale'adike mannaa ha'no Efireemixxenna Minaasexxe oddo'n ofoldine'eechchi Efireeminaa'n baajjineeten» hinemmaxxee Gale'adik manni Efireemika manna lole. <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Gele'adito Efireemike bogibaa foosamaka Yordaanoosika galaana abinde; baaje fulo'a mitti Eefireemichchi foofo'a eeti'i insa'nee laqedhaa wodda Gele'adiki manni, «Ati Eefireemike bogike manjo?» hine isoo qorraaman iikki manjichhcinna, «Waawwoti!» hiyyoole; <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />insa'nenna, «Shibooleti» hiyyi hinaan; isi kinni hiyyichchoo toggi asse hiisebaang «Siboolit» hiyyoole isoo Yordaanoosike galaana foofatixxe bakkuwwanaa'n mittete'n isoo abinde shinnaan; eettene yanna'ni shoole tommenna lami kumi Efireemik manni shiyeme.<verse eid="JDG 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Yoftaahe jaane wogga duuchcha Isira'eelii murte akeekisanjoke kade. Gele'adichchi Yofitahe reye; isinna Gele'adike qachchuwwi giddii'ni mitteke'n moogeme.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibitsaanii'i, Elooniinna Abidoonii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Yofitahee'n itti aaneexxi Beetelihemik Ibitsaan Isira'eelii'i akeeke. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Ibitsaani sase tomme labbaxxa oosenna sase tomma dubarra afeemman; dubarra isika gosa isixxi kadebaake manna'n heerunsise; isixxe gosa kadebaake dubarra labbaxxa ifixxe oose'anna aadhise; torbaane wogga Ibitsaan Isira'eelii'i akeeke. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Ibitsaaninna reye Beetelihemi'n moogeme.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Isi uduma Zabilonichchi Eelooni Isira'eelii'i tomme wogga akeeke. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Ookoneechchi uduma Eelooni reye; Zabilonixxe galcha giddo hedheeke Ayyaloonike boga'n moogeme.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Eloonii'ni itti aaneexxi Piri'atoonik Hilelik belti Abidooni Isira'eelii'i akeeke. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Abitsaanna torbaane tomme harre'n gulufaaxxa shoole tomme labbaxxa oosenna sase tomme oosetixxa oose afeemmani. Isinna saddeeta wogga Isira'eelii'i akeeke. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Ookoneechchi uduma Hilelik belti Abidooni reye; koobitike Amaaleqitotike boga'n Efireemixxe galcha giddo Piri'atooni moogeme.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s1">Somisoonixa Ilensha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Isira'eelik ardi higgeen Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo fuggoxxa yaane hunje; tennexxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti insa'nee Filisixeemik mannixxe anga'n shoole tomme wogga hiremmaashsha sa'isse uwwe.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Ookkone baro'n Tsoori'a hiyyemaake qachcha'n Daanixxe gosik Maanuhe hiyyemaak manjichchi hedhemman; isixxi arenna maseentote kademmaxxee isi'a finna ildeemmabaan. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimik erganjinna ise'n leelleexxi isee hiyyee qici, «Kunse ati maseentoten finnakanna ildabexxon; yaane kinni siila'witatton, labbakanna ildatton. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Yoonna xexe'ati woyinet bookanna kadi wele machchoosaaka ha'wo ha'witoxxe'e; battitte yaanenna ittoxxe'e. <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />Kunse ati siila'witatton; labbaka ildatton; iikki beltinna amatike gadamesinaa'n safeexxi Naazirichcho kadati Magenokee gargar foyemeke kadammaxxee isike umika ordichcho haado tuqqabaan; isinna Isira'eelito Filsixeemike mannixxe anganaa'n anjira safaan.»<verse eid="JDG 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Ookkoneechchi uduma iitti manjichcho daggeexxi ifike aro'o'n hitee qici: «Mageniink manji mitti anibaa dageen; isinna Mageniinka iimika erganjo fakkataakenna lumooshsha alalshaakemman; habaan dageexxa isoon qorbe'no; isinna ifika summa ane'n kulebaan. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Yaane kinni isi anee, ‹Ati kunse siila'witatton; iikki beltinna amatike gadaanesinaa'n safeexxi reyaa qico'n Magenokee foyemeeke naazirichcho kadammaxxee ta'a woyinetixxa booka machchoositaaxxa yaanenna ha'witoxxe'e; battitte yaanenna ittoxxe'e› hiyyeen hite kulde.»<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Maanuhe, «Ee, dada duuchchike Goottaa! Ookkonee ilemaaka belto hitta assine nosinannoxxa no'oo barachchiiso'a no'obaa ergitettak iikki Mageniinki manji higeenna dagaashsha assittota'a atee kadhantaannen» hiyya'n Duuchchi Woddika Gootta soodate.<verse eid="JDG 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Magenikinna Maanuhexxa soodachcho laqe; iima erganjinna iitti manjichcho fichchi giddo hexxee'naa ise'n leelle; eettenna yanna kinni aro'i isike Maanuhe sinni welti hedhemmabaan. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Isenna ifike aro'o'n kulatee wiinamik marteexxi iso'n, «Iikki edi wodda ane'n leellemak manjichchi techchonna ane'n leelle» hite.<verse eid="JDG 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Maanuhenna ke'eexxi are ifixxa hordofe; isinna ookkone manjichchinbaa dageexxi «Anxe aren haasootte'ettak atetemma'a?» hiyya'n isoo qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 13:11">Isinna, «Eeti! Anten» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Maanuhe, «Haasottettek haaso'i muuxemaa yanna ookkone beltixxi hedho hitta akeekkenda? No'ota isi'a maa assa hassissa?» hiyye isoo qore.<verse eid="JDG 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimik erganji isoo hiyyee qici, «Are atixxi ani ise'ni haaso'ennexxa duuchcha assitowwaal. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Isenna woyinetike hiddichchonaa'ni heene yaanenna ittoqqe'e; woyinetixxe bookanna kaddo wele machchossaachcho ha'witoqqe; battooteexxa yaanenna ittoqqe'e ani ise'ni ajajeennexxa duuchcha heqqexxowwaali.»<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Maanuhe Duuchchi Woddike Goottika iimika erganjo, «Re'eti buruusa dulle ati'aa qophpheesinanno qico'ni heqqi ballo» hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimik erganji Maanuhee'e, «Ati kaba anee'e tursitottolenna midde shiqishaatexxa heene itanna ani itabe'non. Yaane kinn ciincatika tolcha qophpheessitaattole isoo Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqish» hiyye. Maanuhenna haasessa'nek Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimika erganjo kadeexxanna ege'neemmabaan.<verse eid="JDG 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Maanuhenna Duuchchi Woddik Goottika iimika erganjo, «Haasootettek hiyyichchi muuxemaa wodda galata ati'a shiqinshonnaa summi atiki ayyete?» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottik iimik erganjinna, «Anki summi mambe'iinke kadeemmaxxe'e, mayee'e anee qortaatte?» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:29">Dada. 32:29</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Maanuhenna mitte re'eti buruusanna midhatik tolcha aadheexxi kinoti hana Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolche. Maanuhenna are isixxi illeti uundaa'naani Duuchchi Woddik Gootti mambe'iinxa yaane asse. <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Eettene giirak bubenji tolchimalchoke'ni iimi'a me'aa wodda Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimik erganji ookkone buben giddo iimi'a me'e. Maanuhenna isixxi are tenne uunde albik buttinake'n wabbi hine. <verse eid="JDG 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottik iimik erganji Maanuhe'ninna are isixxe'ni langaxxa leella gopheemmaxxe'e; edise insa'ne'a leellemak Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki iimike erganjo kadeexxa Maanuhe ege'ne.<verse eid="JDG 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Maanuhenna are ifixxa, «Mageno uundennaxxe'e yoona mami belo no'aa reyonden!» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Are isixxi isi'aa hiisiteexxi hitee qici, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'oo shiya'neele ciincatikanna midhatika tolcha silaa anga no'oxxenaa'ni adhdhammabaan; iittanni tenne yaane duuchcha no'o'ni leelishshanna iitta hexxeexxa yaane iitte wodda no'o'ni kulammabaan.»<verse eid="JDG 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Iitti manjichcho labbaka belto ilde; summakanna Somisooni hite fulchite. Iikki beltinna nophphe Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna isoo eebise. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki Hafuurinna Tsoori'anna Eshita'oolixxe oddo'ni hedheeke Daanike olla'i giddo hedhee'naa'a isoo'o jabeessa safe.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s1">Somisoonixxa Aadha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Barra mitte Somisooni Timinaa adadde me'e: ookkonna Filisixeemixxe gosa kaddeexxa mitte meyyaxxa manjichcho uude: <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Baxxe'a higeeshanni anna ifike'ninna amate'n «Timinake boga'n hexxeexxe Filisixeemixxe dubarte giddii'n mitte afe eeyyennaxxee ani isee anee aadhisse» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Annikinna ama isixxi kinni, «Jatik firuwwinaa'n yookaan no'oke ardi duuchchinaa'n ati'a kaddaaxxa belto haano gophende'naate eettene jala ofolbaaxxe Filisixeemitotiba martetek?» hine.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:3">Somisooninna anna ifika, «Ane godobi aageexxi ise kaddeemmaxxe isee anee aadhisi» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />Eettene yanna'n Isira'eelito galcha'emmak Filsixeemitoteke kaddeemmxxe Filisixeemitoti welt wel gonphe hexxaashsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti eeyyeexxi asseexxe kaddeexxe kaddeexxa ani isikinna ama isixxi ege'ne'emmabaan.<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Somisooni ifike annininna amati welti Timinaa addadde me'e; ookkonna mitte woyinetike hiddichike fichchi giddo genneeshshanni dedhange'n mitti neenqiink beltanji harqa'n isibaa dage. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />Eettene yana Duuchchi Woddike Goottik Hafuuri Samison'ii hunnati dirre; tennexxee re'etik buursi kukutaammashsha anga ifixxe mittichchinna hedhebaang ookkonee neenqiinka beltanjo kukute; tenne asseexxa yaaenna ifike anna'ninna ifixxe ama'n kulebaan.<verse eid="JDG 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Ookkoneechchi uduma eettene manjichchoba addadde mare; isenni weltinna haasoe'e; lumooshshanna isee eeyye. <verse eid="JDG 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Heenooxxe barra uduma isee aadhatee ookko'a illeema hige me'e; ookkone neeqiinka renshanna uudatee ora me'ani gore; ookkone renshi giddo kinniisi heesseexxi malese'naa afe. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Ookkone malebinaa'n adheexxi muxedha'n me'e; ifika annanna ama ifixxe afemeeshshanni ookkone malebonaa'n insa'ne'a uwwe; insa'nenna inde; yaane kinni Samison ookkone, malebo adheek neenqiinke renshi giddii'nite kaddeexxa insa'ne'n kuleemmabaan.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Somisoonik anni eettene manjichocho uudo'a addadde dirre; Somisooninna ookkone woddixxe waajubichchiinxe aadashsha ookko ita ha'wa qophpheesse. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Filsixemik manni isoo uundeexxe yanna isinni welti turtaashsha sase tomme labbaxxa dargaggeeyye isi'a uwwe. <verse eid="JDG 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Somisooninna insa'nee hiyyee qici, «Laqqe, hiibbo mitte ha'no kulo; isexxa tikanna eette aadha heerumiinke aayyaanixxe torbaane barrake giddo ani'a hiissichcho uutinoole fuuti suqeme ganemeexxa sase tomme qeerraxa semmanna sase tomme jijjiidhatixxa seemma ha'no'a uwwannon. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Eettene hiibbo tika gophphinoole kinni fuuti suqeme ganemeexxa sase tomme qeeraxxa seemmanna sase tomme jijjiidhatixxa seemma ha'no'a ani'a uutinaan.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:13">Insa'nenna isoo, «Eettene atixxa hiibo no'o'n kuli lanqo» hine.<verse eid="JDG 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Samisooninna insa'ne'n</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:14">«Itallokenaa'n ita</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 14:14">ookkone jabinaa'ninna xe'maxxi yaane fulde» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 14:14">Insa'enna sase barra qico'n eettene hiibbo tika dandenneemmaba'a.<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />Sholgaxxe barra'n Somisoonixxa are, «Aro'o atika laanchite hiibbo tennexxa tika no'o'a kulaashsha assi; iitta assa gophphottole ateenna atike annika mini hado giirati gunbannon; adanna ha'no no'oo yexxine itisine ha'wisineechchi mulqexxino'atee?» hine.<verse eid="JDG 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Somisoonixxi are ooxxa'n isi edo shiqqeexxi isoo, «Adana ati anee jibbita'ette! Anee eetabexxoxxi dhugaaten! Hite haranga boshshexxeette!» hite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:16">Isinna isee «Ani tennee'e anke anna'n kadi anxe ama'n kuleebe'non; mayeeta ate'n kulanno?» hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Isixxi arenna eettene aadha heerumiinxe torbaane ayyaanixxe barra duuchcha'n ooxxa'n dhukkussiisse isoo qortemmaxxee muuxamiinxe torbaxxe barra'n eettene hiibboxxa tika ise'n kule; isenna iittanni eettene hiiboxxa tika arda ifike'n kulde.<verse eid="JDG 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Tennexxe arishsho e'itebaangi edi darre torbaxxe barra'n qachchiink manni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">«Malebo sa'ee xe'maalchi mayi hedhe'naa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 14:18">Neenqa sa'eek hunnaameessi habadhee!» hine'e hiibbo tinke iso'ni kulle.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:18">Somisooninna hiisseexxi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">«Anke goronsinni huja gophphineele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 14:18">hiisichcho dandeettine hiissitinammabaan» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddike Goottik Hafuuri hunnati Saamisooni'ni dage; isinna Asiqeloonami'a mare sase tomme manna shiye; insa'neexxa elolla seemmuwwa duuchcha fulcheexxi hiibbo tikemmake manni'a uwwe. Isinna tenne aarenni ke'eexxi ifike annibaa'a hige. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />Somisoonixxi arenna aadhati baro jaaloke kadeenge'e heerunde.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="s1">Somisooni'n Filixi'eemik Manni Halo fule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />Heenoxxe yanna uduma dinne haa'minamaxxe mayetixxe yanna'n Somisooni mitte re'eti buruusa abixxe are ifixxa uudo'a mare. Isinna, «Are anixxi hexxeexxe dukkobaa ma'yoo» hiyye; anni iseki kinni eetti'i isi'aa uwwebaan. <verse eid="JDG 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />Anni isekinna, «Ati isee'e jibbiteettexxa ege'neenaxxe'e aadhdhati barike atike jaali'a isee heerunsiseenen; maa'nichcho isexxi ise caala danchatebaa? Isee aadhi» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Somisooninna hiisexxi, «Ta'inni edi'aa Filisixeemik manna'n geltaaxxe miidhenshanni ani laqemabo'non!» Hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Isinna ookko'ni fule me'eexxi sase dhibba jeedaluwwa abide. Isinna lame jeedalixxa eege mitteba usureechchi uduma xassa aadhexxi mitteba abidiseemmaxxe eegenni welti usure. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma xassa giirati abidiseexxi ookkone jeedaluwwa haamendeexxe Filsixeemike mannixxe dinne'ni wocci asse. Isinna haammende tuulendeexxe calla kaddeebaangi fichchi giddo hexxeenxa dinne, ejersiinkanna woyinetike haqichchika hiddichcho mitteba gube. <verse eid="JDG 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />Filisixeemik manninna «tennee asseeki ayyete?» hiyyeexxi qorree. Insa'enna «are isixxa aadheexxi isike aadhati barike jaalo'n heerunsiiseemmaxxee Timinake qachchike manjichchike ballo Somisooniten» hine. Tennexxee Filisixxeemmik manni ookko mareexxi eettene manjichchonna anna iseka giirati gube shiyye.<verse eid="JDG 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Somisooni, «Ha'no tennee'e assitinoole ani kinni ha'noo'n halo fulebo'nok udumi'a higabo'non» Hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Isinna insa'nee loleexxi fuggo miidhdhe; insa'ne giddii'inna heddo manna shiye. Ookkoneechchi uduma isinna adadde dirreexxi Etaami hiyyemaake boonchixxe kinjiinxe wolo'o giddo ofo'le.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saamisoon Filisixxeemika Manna Injifate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Filisixeemik manni Yihuda dage qecece; insa'nenna Leehi hiyyemaaka qachcha abixxine. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Yihudak manni, «No'oo loldino'a daggineechchi mayeete?» Hiyye insa'ne qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:10">Insa'nenna «No'o dangennelchi Somisooni'i abixxateenna isi no'o'ni asseexxa no'onna iso'ni assinnonnaaten» hine insa'ne'a hiisine. <verse eid="JDG 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Ookkoneechchi uduma sasi kumi manni Yihudaa'ni ke'eexxi Etaami hexxeexxe wolo'oba dirrineexxi Somisooni'i, «Filisixeemik manni moye no'oo galcha'neeke manna kadeexxa egendeeboxxoo? Ati no'o'ni assiteettexxi yaane maachchosi?» Hine isoo qorre. Saamisooninna, «Ani asseenexxi insa'ne'ne ane'ni assinemmaxxen» Hiyye insa'ne'a hiise.<verse eid="JDG 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Insa'nenna, «No'o dangennelchi ate'e usurre Filsixeemike manni'a uunonnaa'a kunni dangeenen» hine.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:12">Somisooninna, «Ha'noo umi ha'noongeninna anee'e shinnabo'noni hitine kakatte» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Insa'nenna, «Atee usurre anga insa'nexxe'ni sa'isine uunnanno malee'e no'o atee shinnaabo'non» hine. Ookkoneechchi uduma lame haarollamma wodaronni iso'o usurreexxi kinjiinxe wolo'o giddii'ni fulchine.<verse eid="JDG 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Somisooninna Leehi geyeeshshanni Filisixeemik manni raarra'ni isibaa dage; eettenne yanna Duuchchi Woddike Goottik Hafuuri hunnati Somisooni'ni dirre. Anga isixxi usurendeemmaxxi wodaronna giira giddo ibbeexxe layinotixxe seemmashsha baqqeexxi isixxe anganaa'n ibbe. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Ookkoneechchi uduma shiqixxe yanna'ni rerteexxe harexxa boqo afeexxi buttiin aadhe; isinna eettene boqonni mitte kuma manna shiye.<verse eid="JDG 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Somisooninna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 15:16">«Mitte harretixxe boqonni kuma manna shiyennene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 15:16">mitte harretixxe boqonni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 15:16">renshange'ni hana rensha anbennen» hiyye geerare.<verse eid="JDG 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Isinna tennee haaso'e bireeshanni anga abixxemmaxxa harretixxa boqo darbe; eettene bakkanna «Raamaati Leehi»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Raamati Leehi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiyya </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ibrititotikenni Boqotike tullichcha hiyyaten.</char></note> hiyyeme ye'eme.<verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Saamisooninna yo'oshsha dheebo'weemmaxxe'e, Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa hiyyee soodatee qici, «Yoonna erganjo atikee'e tenne jabaxxa injifachcho uutetten; taa ani wode'e dheebonni reyonaatee? Konne jila ofo'lebaake mannixxe anga'ni ani ibonnaatee?» Hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Mageninna Leehike boga'ni rassatenaa'n wode'e isi'a fulche; Somisooninna ookkone wode'e ha'wee jabaateexxi hafuurakanna hiissedhe. Tennexxe eettene muumme Ayini Haqore<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ayini Hanqore </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibritotikenni Ye'eekixxe muume hiyyaten.</char></note> hiyyeme. Itti bakkanna telchi qico Leekike boga'n afendaan.<verse eid="JDG 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Somisooninna Filisixeemik mannike baro'ni Isira'eel giddo lame tomme wogga akeeke.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s1">Somisooni Gaazake Bogga'n</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Barra mitte Somisooni Gaaza'a me'e. Isinna ookko mitte yabaabulto manjichcho uudeexxi isenni welti galo'a iseke minibaa e'ye. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Gaazak manninna «Somisooni kaba hedheen!» hitaa odo insa'ne gelte; tennexxee mannikinna ookoone booncho buqeexxi hashsha duuchcha qachchiinke dalla'ixxe hulabaa rinphe isoo heqqine; «Bariisanni isoo shinnannon» hina'n bogi soodaa qico'ni rinpheenba galle. <verse eid="JDG 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Yaane kinni Somisooni manjichchoti welti diiphemak hashshixxe jaane saate qico'n callamman; isinna ke'eexxi qachchiinke dalla'ixxa hula, lamiinga utuphanna danqarisanjo fottose. Ookkoneechchi uduma isi konneechuwwa dugummoti uggudheexxi Kebirooni edo hexxeexxe tullichuwwiinxe xungo qico'ni dulke qabate.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Saamisoon Sooreeqixxe dhooqa'ni hexxa'neexxa Deliila hinaaxxa manjichcho eeyye. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Filisixeemik galchalluwwi isebaa mareexxi, «Maxxisse'e iso'ni hexxeexxi jabaxxi hunna tinni maachcho kaddeexxa, no'onna iso'o usurree anga no'oxxe'ni hitta ibirsa dandeennanoxxa ati no'aa isoo qori. Tenne assitottole no'o mitti mittiingi mitte kumanna mitte dhibba sibiljo birre uunannon.»<verse eid="JDG 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Tennexxe Deliila Somisoonii'i, «Konne qico atee'e Jabake assa'negeechchi maachcho kadeenxa ane'ni haaso'i ballo; mitti manji atee usure'e hunna affabexxoshsha hite gophisaa qici hedhee?» hite.<verse eid="JDG 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Somisooninna ise'ni, «Shamoke torbaane teephuwwinni fedheeki manji anee usurreele hunna afabo'no.»<verse eid="JDG 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Filisixeemik galchaluwwa shamoka torbaane teephuwwa Daliila'a aa'ne dange: isenna konneechchinn Saamisoon'i usurte. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Mannikinna goli giddo sho'omeeman; isenna, «Koo, Somisooni! Filisixeemito kunni ate'n daggeen» hite. Yaane kinn Somisooni suqendeexxa shalo giira tuqqoole husuphphi hitammashsha ookkonee teephuwwa sholla qicinni husuphphi asse. Tennexxee isixxe hunna mayenaa'nite kaddeexxa ege'nendebaan.<verse eid="JDG 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Deliilanna Somisoonii'i, «Yoonna ati anee gowwiseeten; dhugaa fulchite ane'ni haasootebexxon; ballo maganne ta'anna atee hitta usura dande'anoxxa ane'ni kuli!» hite.<verse eid="JDG 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Isinna Daliila'a, «Dullootebaaxxe haaroxxe wodaronni ane'e usurreele wele manjishshann hunna afannabaan» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Deliilanna haarooxxa wodaro aaxxe Somisoonii'i usurte; manni goli giddo sho'omeemman; isenna, «Koo Saamisooni Filisixeemito kunni ate'n daggeen» hite. Yaane kinn isi usureemmaxxa wodaro agooda ifikenaa'ni fuufa sunqeekishsha usurra tanshe.<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Higgeeni Deliila Somisoonii'i, «Ta'i qico'ni anee'e gowwiseeten; dhugaa fulchite ane'ni haasoteeboxxen; ballo maganne hitta atee'e usurra dandeessisaaxxa ane'ni kule» hite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:13">Isinna hiisexxi, «Anka konne torbaane umiinka shuroota umiinke ordichchinni welti gudunfite'e isoo tutunjoke'ni sagartetele; ani wele manjishshanni shaqqake kadanon» isee hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Daliilanna isi diipheexxa affeexxi ookkone torbaane isike umika shuroota umiinxe ordichchinni welti gudunfite tutunjoke'ni sagartetteexxi «Koo, Somisooni! Filisixeemito kunni ate'n daggeen!» Hite. Isinna mugokenaa'ni dammaqe, tutunjo umiinke haadinninni fooqqi asse ke'ise.<verse eid="JDG 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Ookkoneechchi uduma isenna, «Godobi atik aninni welti hedhebaang hitta ‹Ate'e eeyyanen› hitattoo? Ati anee'e sobbaa'naanna ta'i qico'ni tenne hunna duuchcha habaa'ni aaxxetexxa ane'ni haasoteboxxon» hite. <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Isenna barra barrande'ni isoo nunnusita'ni reyo yoraa qico'ni wixixxi assite. <verse eid="JDG 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />Tennexxe isi duuchchiinxa yaane ise'ni hiyye kulee qici, «Ilemeennexxinninni Magenokee gargar foyemeeneke kadeennaxxe'e umo ankikka ordichcho haado tuqqebaan. Yaane kinn umo anika haadoti haandele hunna anenaa'ni me'itaani; aninna shaqqe wele manjishshanni kadanon hiyye'e godobixxa ise'ni haaso'e.»<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Deliilanna isi duuchchiinxa yaane farri asse haaso'eexxa affeexxi, Filisixxeemmike galchaluwwi'a «Isi duuchchiinxa yaane farri asse ane'ni haaso'eemmaxxe'e higgine dagge» hiteexxi Filsixeemike galchaluwwibaa erga ergite. Insa'nenna sibiljo birre aa'ne dange. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Deliila, Saamisoonii'i isenge gudeedda'ni diiphisse'e mugaashsha assiteechchi uduma mitte manjo yexxeexxi ookkone torbaane isike umika shuroota insa'ne haadisse. Isenna Saamisooni'i wixixxi assate'ni kexxe; hunnatinna isonaa'ni adhdhende. <verse eid="JDG 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Ookkoneechchi uduma isenna, «Koo, Somisooni! Filisixeemito kunni ate'n daggeen!» Hite. Isinna diiphokenaa'ni dammaqeexxi, «Edi woddishshanni hasaphi asse me'ano» hiyye hede. Yaane kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti isinaa'ni gargar higeexxa afeemmabaan. <verse eid="JDG 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Filisixeemito Saamisoon'i abideexxi ille isixxa balleesine Gaaza'a aa'ne dirrine. Insa'nenna isoonna sageettotike haachchabinni usurreexxi ookko'o usuremmeeba midha dayaashsha assine: <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Yaane kinni umo haadeemmeechchi haaroba umi isiki late.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Somisoonixxa Reyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Filisixeemik galchaluwwanna, «No'oki magen naapha no'oka Somisoonii'i anga no'oxxe'ni sa'isse uwween» hina'ni mageno insa'neeke Daagoni'a lumoka tolcha shiqishatee'e bukki hine.<verse eid="JDG 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Ardikinna Saamisonii'i uude wodda, mageno insa'neka Daagooni'i galateefatati, «Boga no'oo tutunseeka heddo no'oka manjo shiyeeka, no'oka naapha, no'oki magen anga no'oxxe'ni sa'isse uwween» hine.<verse eid="JDG 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Qalbe insa'nexxi yo'oshsha gammaddee wodda, «No'o geebiso'a Somisooni'i ye'we» hine. Insa'nenna Saamisoonii'i usuriinke minenaa'ni ye'ne, isinna insa'ne edo sirbe; isoonna ookkone utuphuwwiinxe odo'ni uurrinse. <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Somisooninna anga ifixxa abide akeekammaka belto, «Mine kiphe abideemmake utuphuwwa'ni irkattonna'a anee'e shikki assi» hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Ookkone mini giddo labballinna dubarte wo'miteemman; Filisixeemik galchalluwwi duuchchinna ookko'o hedheman; ookkone minixxe xelpho'ni Somisooni sirbaa'na uudamak sase kuma geyaak labbalinna dubarte hexxeman. <verse eid="JDG 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Somisooninna «Lamiinxe ille anxee'e Filisixeemika manna ta'a halo fulonnaa'a, Ee, dada duuchchike Duuchchi Woddike Goottaa, ballo anee'e hedi, Ee, Magenoo tennee'e mittele calla ballo anee jabeessi» Hiyye Duuchchi Woddika Gootta soodate. <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Somisooni mine kiphe abideemmaka lamiinga utuphuwwa abixxe; mitte middixxe anganni mitte bita'ixxe anganni jabeesse abixxeexxi, <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />«Filsixeemike manninni welti reyannon» hiyyati afeexxe hunnanni utuphaa dhiibe wodda, iikki mininna Filisixxeemmike galcha; uwwa'ninna ookko'o hedheeke duuchcha'ni ibe. Somisooni lubbo hedhemma wodda shiyeeke manni caala reyee wodda shiyeeke mannik bira sa'e.<verse eid="JDG 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Isixxi dayyuwwanna gateek isik mini hadi rensha aadhdhatee ookko'aa dirrine; insa'nenna idangeexxi isike annik Maanuhek hirreesi hedheeba Tsoori'axxenna Eshita'oolixxe oddo'ni isoo moonge. Saamisooni Isira'eeli'ni lame tomme wogga akeekisanjo kade.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s1">Miikka Hujeexxa Misechchixxa Fakkuwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Miika hiyyemaak manjichchi tullichiinke Efireemike boga'ni hedhaamman. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />Isinna barra mitte amaa ifixxa hiyyee qici, «Mitti manjchchi mitte kumanna mitte dhibba sibiljo birre atenaa'n mooree wodda ookkone'e mooremmaka manjichcho baddaa'naa laqeennan: iikki birretik siblji anixxe anga'ni hedheen; ookkone birreti sibljonna ante aadheennani.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:2">Ookkoneechchi uduma ama isixxinna isoo'o, «Anike beltoo! Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atee'e eebisoo!» hite.<verse eid="JDG 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Beltkinna ookkone mitte kumanna mitte dhibba birreti sibljo aadheexxi ama isixxee uwwe; amatinna, «Sibljo birre anixxenni bonce giissendeexxa fakkuwwa baqinse giisineexxa misile giisedhatee anke beltixxe hiyye'e anga anixxenni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a gargar foyanon; ta'anna ati'aani hiise uwwanen» isoo hite. <verse eid="JDG 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Tennexxee belti birreti sibljo ama isixxee'e hiise; ama isixxinna isi hanii'ni lame dhibba birreti sibljinaa'n aaxxe'e birreti sibljo baqisaammake'e uutte; baqisanjikinna bonceexxe fakkenna baqinsee giisineexxe fakke asse. Iitti fakkuwwanna Miikake mine'ni ofolde.<verse eid="JDG 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Kunni Miika hiyyemeek manjichchi ifika magenoonfachchotixxa bakka afeemman; isinna heddo fakkuwwa mitte Efuudinna Teraafemi'i hujeexxi isixxe oose giddii'n mitti ookko qeese kade ergatemmaashsha asse. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" />Ookkone baro'ni Isira'eelike boga'n moyanji hedhemmabaan; mitti mitting manji ifi'aa eldeenxa yaane assaamman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 21:25">Hay. 21:25</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Eettene yanna'n Yihudake boga'ni, Beetelihemike qachcha'n hedhaammak mitti Leewwichchi dargaggeesi hedhemman; <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />kunni manjichchinna hedha'neka booncho halsatee'e ookkone Beetelihemi Yihudake qachchinaa'ni fule. Isi me'ande'ni hedhe'naa tullichiinke Efireemike boga'ni hedheeke Miikake minibaa dage.<verse eid="JDG 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Miikanna isoo'o, «Ati habaa'ni daggette?» Hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:9">Isinna, «Ani Yihudake bogi giddo hexxeexxe Beetelihemi'n dageeneke Leewwichchon; ani hedhanno bonchonna harsedhaannen» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />Miikanna, «Yoonna amoo ani bira ofo'li, anke annanna qeesichcho anke kadi; aninna woggate'ni tomme sibiljo birrenna iittanni seemmanna ittaa uwwannon» hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Tennexxe iikki Leewwichchi Miikanni welti hedhatee'e mudhdhe iikki dargaggeessi qeesichchi Miika'aa isixxe oosse giddii'ni mittiinsha kade. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Miikanna Leewwichcho qeesette asse file; Miikanna isike mine'ni ofo'le. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Miikanna hiisexxi; «Kunni Leewwichchi qeesete ani'aa kadeexxe'e, Duuchchi Woddik Gootti duuchchiinxa yaane ani'aa qajeelchaaxxa ege'neenen» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s1">Daaniki Manni Layyishshii Qececceexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />Ookkone baro'ni Isira'eel giddo moyanji hedhemabaan; Daanike mini mini hadi Isira'eelike mini mini hadixxe oddo'ni ifike hinaaka bogika qadaada afaa gonpheemmaxxe'e marre ofollaaka ifike hinaaka boga harsinaaman. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Tennexxee Daanito ookkone boga dooyinaashshanna qo'nisaashsha onde jabaka manna Tsoori'anna Eshita'oolike qachchuwwibaa ookko'a ergine; kunniirinna ifi ifika mini hado tukkeesakeeramman. Insa'ne ergeek manninna hiyyee qici, «Me'ee, ookkone boganna dooyye» hine.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 18:2">Insa'nenna ookkone tulcha Efireemike bogiba Miikake miniba dangeexxi ookko'o galle. <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Insa'nenna Miikake mini bira genneeshshanni dargaagrrsa Leewwixxa qonqo foone egenne; tennexxe ookko'o gorreexxi, «Ayyete atee'e kabaa aadhdhe dageeki? Kaba maa hujjaate? Kabaa daggeetek mayeetee?» Hine qorre.<verse eid="JDG 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Isinna, «Miikaa tennee yaane ani'a asse'e huje abidiseene; aninna qeese kadennen» insa'ne'aa hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma insa'nenna, «Ori no'ok qajeeleexxa qajeelaa gopheexxa egenannoshsha ballo Mageno no'aa laqi» hine.<verse eid="JDG 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Qeesichchikinna, «Me'itinna'neeka ora Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'no'aa qajeelcheemmaxxe'e ha'no nage'ik me'ee» insa'ne'aa hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Tennexxee iikki ondi manni ookkoo'n ke'eexxi Layyishi dange; Siidoonito mitte soda'a belo nage'ik hedhammashshanni ookko'o hedhaamak manni ti'ni hiyye hedha'neexxa uunde. Iikki bogi duuchchiinxa yaane afeemmaxxe'e iikki ardi dureesakemman. Iittanni insa'nenna Sidoonake mannanaa'ni bayyante'e manjo duuchchanaa'ni gargar hingee qoffinni he'naaman. <verse eid="JDG 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Insa'nenna ifike dayyuwwa Tsoori'anna Eshita'ooli'aa hingee, insa'nek dayyuwwinna, «Martineexxi yaane hitta kaddee?» Hine qorre. <verse eid="JDG 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />Iikki erga me'eemmaki manninna insa'nee hinee qici, «Iikki bogi yo'oshsha eloke kadeexxa uundeennen; yoonna ke'wee! Marrenexxi insa'nee'e lollo; ke'we malee'e sammi hitinaa? Ha'noonna martineexxi ookkone boga abidatee hoodinnoqqe'e, <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />ha'noonna ookko'o geltinaa wodda nage'ik hedha'neek ardi, Mageni anga ha'nooxxe'ni sa'isse uwwaaka mitte yaanenna xe'itebaaka ba'laka boga ha'no'aa isi uwwe'een.»<verse eid="JDG 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Daanixxe gosanaa'ni lolakee qophpheefateeka jaane dhibba manna Tsoori'anna Eshita'oolii'ni ke'neexxi me'ine. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Insa'nenna ookko'ni fulleexxi Yihudake bogi giddo Qiriyaatiyi'aarimi qecence. Yoonna Qiriyatiyi'aarimii'n boroti darree'ne hedheek boonchchi telchi qico'ni Daanike olla'a hiyyemmeek tennenaa'ni kexxeexxen. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Insa'nenna ookko'ni ke'neexxi tullichiinke Efireemike bogibaa me'ine Miikake minibaa dange.<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Layyishika boga dooyeemmak iikki ondi manni dayyuwwa ifikee'e, «Konne minuwwi giddii'ni mitteke'ni Efuudi, Teraafem, bonceexxi fakkenna baqinse giisinexi misile hexxeexxa ha'no egendine'ee? Yoonna ha'no maa assa hasisaaxxa ege'ne» hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Tennexxe iikki dargaggeesi Leewwichchi hedhamake Miikake miniba gorreexxi nage'a isi'a shiqinshe. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Lolake qophpheefante dageemak jaani dhibbi Daanik manni eetene dalla'iinxe hula bira uureemman. <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />Iikki qeesichchi lolake qophpheefateeke jaane dhibba manninni welti eetten dalla'iinxe hula'ni uure'naa, ookkone boga dooyate'e dageemmak ondi manni Miikake mini giddo e'yeexxi bonceexxa fakkenna Efudii'i, Teraafemuuninna baqinse giisineexxa fakke adhdhine.<verse eid="JDG 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Kunni manninna Miikake miniba e'yeexxi bonceexxa fakkenna Efuudii, Teraafemuuninna baqinse giisineexxa fakke adhdhinee wodda iikki qeesichchi, «Maa assitina'nesi?» Insa'nee hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />Inisa'nenna, «Sammi hiyyi! Ittanna bucuqqi hitoxxee! Ati no'onni welti dagge'e annakenna qeesete no'aa kadi. Ati'aa mitte minike qeesichcho kada mannii'ni Isira'eel giddo mitte minikenna gosatike qeesichcho kadde ergatendetele woyyabaa?» isoo hine. <verse eid="JDG 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Ookkoneechchi uduma iikki qeesichchi yo'oshsha gammade, isinna Efuudii'i, Teraafemuuninna bonceeexxa fakke aadhdheexxi ardik welti me'e.<verse eid="JDG 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Insa'nenna oose insa'nexxa, hore insa'nekika haagananna horanteechcho duuchcha edi'a sa'issineexxi udumi'a hinge me'ine. <verse eid="JDG 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Insa'nenna Miikake minibaa'ni shiixxo qico bayyante me'ineeshshanni, Miikaki olla'uwwi gargaarsake'e ye'emme bukki hine; insa'nenna Daanika mannanna hordonfeexxi dhaqqanbe. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Insa'nenna udumii'ni he'ne insa'ne'ni raarra'na, Daanik manni udumi'a higeexxi Miikaa'a, «Maa kaddeettee? Konnee manna duuchcha bukki assiteetteki mayeetee?» Hine qorre.<verse eid="JDG 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Miikanna hiisexxi, «Hitta, ‹Maa kaddette› hitine ha'noo anee qortina'ne? Ani giisedheenka anka magenuwwanna qeesichcho anka aaxxine me'itine'een; wele yaane ani'aa maachcho gatee?» Hine.<verse eid="JDG 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Iikki Daanik manni hiisexxi, «Aareeti hedheek manni rakko ate'ni geesisee'na atixxanna atike mini hadixxa lubbo gophphaboxxoshsha no'oxxe oddo'ni bucuqqi hitoxxee» hine. <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Tennexxe Daanki manni tenne hiyyeexxi ora insa'neka ke'ne me'ine; Miikanna insa'nee dande'abaaxxa uudexxi ifike minbaa me'e.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Miika giisexxa fakkuwwanna ookkone qeesichcho aa'nexxi Layyishi me'ineexxi, nage'ikinna mitte soda'a belo hedhaamaka arda wolaantichchik shinne; ookkone qachchanna gunbe. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Insa'nenna he'naamak Sidoona'n yo'oshsha bayyateemmaxxenna insa'nenna ayyininna mittooma afa gonpheemmaxxe'e he'nammaxxe'enna weli mannin afema gophphammaxxe'e insa'ne'e injifataak mittikinna hedhemmabaan; iikki qachchinna afema'neek Beetirehobi biramman. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Insa'nenna ookkone qachchanna Isira'eel darree'ni ilemeeke insa'neke anna Daanke summinni Daani hine ye'ne, ookkone qachchik summi qara Layyishitemman. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Ookkonna Daanik manni ifi'aan magenoonfaaxxa fakkuwwa uurinse; Muusek belti, Gershoomik belti Yoonataaninna isixxi oose ookkone boga booji'endeexxa yanna qico'ni Daanke mini hadi'a qeesetemman. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Tennexxe Miika giisexxa fakkuwwa, Mageniik mini Seelo hedhema wodda duuchcha kuta belo magenoonfate.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s1">Mitte Leewwichonna Isixxa Gadhixxa Suumetixxa Jaalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />Ookkone baro'ni Isira'eeli giddo moyanji hedhemmabaan; eettene yanna'ninna tullichiinke Efireemike boga'n hedha'neek mitte Leewwichchoman; kunni manjichchi Yihudaxxee galcha'n hexxeexxe Beetelihemii'n mitte dubarcho shiixxooxxe are assedhe aadhdhe. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Yaane kinn iitti shiixxoxxi isixxi are yabaabulde; isenna isoo waaldeexxi Yihudake boga'ni hedheeke ifike annike minibaa Beetelihemi'aa me'ite. Isenna ookko shoole agenjo turteechchi uduma, <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />iseki aro'i isee araarsedhe ifibaa hiisedho'aa isebaa mare. Isinna maraa wodda ifika garbichchonna lame ifixxa harre abixxeemman. Iitti manjichchonna ifike annike minibaa isoo e'yishshe, iseki anninna isoo uude wodda gammashshotti adhdhe. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Eettene beltok anninna ookkoni turaashsha jabeese isoo kadhate; tennexxe isi ita'ninna ha'wa'ni sase barra isinni welti ookko gale. <verse eid="JDG 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Insa'nenna sholgaxxa barra gorsa bariisa ke'ne, isinna me'atee qophpheefate, eettene beltok anni kinn beltiinka anna hiyyee qici, «Hunna alfitattoshsha edisse'e midha afo'o uggudhi; ookkoneechchi uduma me'itatton» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Tennexxe'e lamiing manni itateenna ha'watee welti ofolle. Beltotik anninna ookkone Leewwichcho, «Ballo telchonna gammada'ni kabanni gali» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Iikki Leewwichchi me'atee ke'eexxi beltotik anni kinni ookko turaashsha malchammale isinna higgeeni ookko gale. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />Ondixxa barra gorsa bariisa iikki Leewwichchi me'atee ke'aa wodda, beltotik anni, «Bllo midha afo'o uggudhi; bogi galgalo'ee'na laanna me'itatton» isoo hiyye; tennexxe iikki lamiing manni isinni welti ite.<verse eid="JDG 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Ookkoneechchi uduma iikki Leewwichchi isixxe shiixxooxxe arenninna garbichchik welti me'atee ke'ee wodda, eettene beltok anni hiyyee qici, «Yoonna bogi hashshe'een kabanni galli; siphphi siphphi hiyye'en galle gammadde; gorsa bariisa kexxineexxi ora ha'nooka me'itinaan» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Yaane kinn iikki Leewwichchi eettene hashsha ookko'o galjetee'e hasebaan, tennexxee feenemmaxxa eettene lame harre nna shiioxxxa are ifixxa aadhdheexxi Iyyaabusi hiyyemaake Iyyerusaalemike qachchibaa me'ine. <verse eid="JDG 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Insa'nenna Iyyaabuusi'a genneeshshanni bogi hashsheemmaxxe'e garbichchi gootta ifkaa, «Amoo ballo'o konne Iyyaabusike qachchibaa gorre'e ookko gallo» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Isiki goottinna, «Isira'eeliki ardi hedha'nebaake qachcha'ni marrabo'non; konne booncho sa'nennexxi Gibi'a marre gallo» hiyye hiise. <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Isinna garbichcho, «Amoo mee Gibi'a yookaan Raama'a geyatee'e wo'laano ookko hedheeke boonchona'ni mitteke'ni gallanonn» hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Tennexxee insa'nenna Iyyerusalemi'i sa'ne ke'ne me'ine; Biiniyaamixxe galcha'ni hexxeexxe Gibi'a genneeshshanni arishsho aagge. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Insa'nenna galjetee ookko'a gorre. Insa'nenna marreexxi ookkone qachchike loolla'ni ofolle; me'ine qachchin qarqara ofolle, yaane kinni mine ifike'ni aadhdhe insa'ne galchaaka mittekanna gonphe.<verse eid="JDG 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Eettene hashsha ookkone tullichiinke Efireemike boganaa'n dage'e Gibi'ake bogi giddo hedha'neek wele bogik geerchi huccammabaa'n hoseebaa'n dage; ookkone bogik manni kinni Biiniyaamitotemman. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Iikki geerchi toggi hiyyeexxi ora me'amaka ookkone qachchik loolla'li uude wodda, «Habaa'n daggete? Habaa me'itaatte?» Hiyye isoo qore.<verse eid="JDG 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Iikki Leewwichchi hiyyee hiise qici, «No'o dangeenki Yihuda Beeteliheemii'n bayyataake tullchuwiinke Efireemike boganaa'niten. Aninna Yihuda Beteliheemi hedhenani; ta'a Duuchchi Woddike Goottike minibaa me'aanen. Anee'e ifike minibaa adhdhaaka manjo afeebo'non. <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />No'o harre no'oxxee biilanna oki'a; no'o garboole atixxi ani'aana kado garbitte atixxee'e, no'onni welti hedheeke dargageesi'a itanna woyinetixxa booka abixxinee en; wele mittiichchinna no'o'aa hasisabaan.»<verse eid="JDG 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Iikki Geerchinna, «Baga nage'ik dagginee! Amme anibaa galle! Ha'no'a hasisaachcho duuchcha shiqishannon; kaba ba'linake'ni galdinnoqqe» hiyye. <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Tennexxe isi ifike minibaa isoo e'yisheexxi eettene harre'a oki'a uwwe. Keesumatinna lekka ifixxa anshexxe; itte, ha'wite.<verse eid="JDG 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Insa'nenna eettene ita ha'wa'ni he'ne'na gammashonde'ni he'nee'na heenok ookkone qachchixxi baashuwwa ookkone mine buqqe; hulatanna ganganna'ni, «Mine e'yishsheetteka manjichcho gadhi'a fulchi Isinni yababullonaa hanseennen!» Hine.<verse eid="JDG 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Ookkone minik anninna gadhi'aa fuleexxi insa'ne hiyyee qici, «Koo anke dayyuwwa, tenne elobaaxxa yaane ballo assitinoqqe'e, kunni manjichchi anke minibaa e'yeemmaxxe'e iitta hexxeexxa cubbo assitinoqqe'e. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Yoona duudo dubarcho kaddeexxi anixxi beltonna ookkone manjichchixxi shiixxoxxi are he'neen. Ani insa'ne ta'anni ha'no'aa gadhi'a fulchee'naa salphisine eetineexxa insa'nee asse. Yaane kinn konnee manjichcho'ni calla iitta hexxeexxa shookishshaaxxa elobaaxxa yaanenna assitinoqqe.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:5-8">Dada. 19:5-8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JDG 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Yaane kinni iikki manni isixxa lanqebaan; tennexxe iikki Leewwichchi shiixxoxxa are ifixxa insa'ne'aa gadhi'aa fulche; iikki manninna manjichchoti yabaabulle; hashsha duuchcha mitti mittik itti isenne galleexxi boro haachchabaa wodda isee'e wocci assine.<verse eid="JDG 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Bogi soodee wodda manjichcho iseki aro'i hedhemmake minibaa higge me'ite. Isenna weddumete'ni arishsho fuldaa qico'ni ookko'o wabbi hite. <verse eid="JDG 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Iseki goottinna bariisanni ke'ee ora me'atee'e huna banee fulaa wodda, shiixxoxxi isixxi are anga hulatibaa farri assiteeshshanni wuddumede'ni ibbee'na afe. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Iikki Leewwichchinna ise'e, «Ke'i, me'inoo!» Hiyye. Yaane kinni ise rerteemmaxxe'e cuqqi hitebaan. Ookkoneechchi uduma rensha ookkone harrichcho'ni fe'eexxi ifike minibaa ke'e me'e. <verse eid="JDG 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Isinna ifike miniba mare geyeeshshanni eettene shiixxoxxa are tommenna lameba kukkuteexxi Isira'eelike boga duuchcha'ni geessise:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 11:7">1 Sam. 11:7</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Tennee uudek duuchchi, «Isira'eelk ardi Gibtsek boganaa'ni fulemaxxe yannanaa'n safee'e iitta hexxeexxa yaane uudendebaan; kadde egendebaan. Yoonna ha'noonna no'o maa assiyyo hasisaaxxa tenne yaane hedde, mari'atte» weli'aan weli Hine.<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s1">Isira'eelk Ardi Biinyaamitotti Lolemme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Daani'ni Bersaabehi qico'ni hedheek iittanni Gele'adike boga'ni hedha'neek Isira'eelik ardi duuchchi mitte manjichcha kandeexxi fulle; insa'nenna Mitsiphake boga'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo bukki hine. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Isira'eelk ardinna mini mini hadik soorsuwwi duuchchi, iittanni buttika lola lola'nik shoole dhibba kuma geeyek loliinka miya ka'leek sannachchi eettene bukki'ni afemeemman. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />Biiniyaamik mini hadi Isira'eelki ardi Mitsipha'a dangeexxa lanqe. Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eelk ardinna, «Tenni fuggoxxi huje hitta muuxendeexxa no'o'ni kulle» Hine. <verse eid="JDG 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Tennexxe iikki shiixxoxxi are isixxi shiyendeemmak Leewwichchi hiyyee qici, «Aninna shiixxoxxi anxi are eettene hashsha sa'issatee'e Biiniyaamixxe galcha'ni hexxeexxe Gibi'a me'inenen. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Gibi'ak manninna ane'e shiyatee'e galeenneka mine hashsha dange bunqe; insa'nenna shiixxoxxe anxe arenni weli duuka yabaabullee'na rerte. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />Aninna shiixxooxxe anxe areka rensha kukkutenchi uduma mitti mittinga kukkute'e, mitti mitteng Isira'eelke boga duuchcha'ni erganneni. Aninna tennee assineelchi iikki ardi Isira'eel'ni salphisaaxxanna hunjabaaxxa huje muuxxeemmaxxeten. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Ta'anna ha'noo Isira'eelk ardi duuchchi tenne yaanexxe'e mar'atte; murte ha'nooxxa uwwe.»<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Ardi duuchchi mitteba higeexxi hiyyee qici, «No'o giddii'ni mitti manjinna duunkaani giddi'a e'yinabo'non; mittikinna ifike minibaa marrabe'non. <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Yaane kinni assinannoxxi yaane hixa ibinsenexxi Gibi'ake boga'n lola kelisaaka manjo fillanon. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Insa'nenna Isira'eeli'ni hunjeexxe battitte yaane Biiniyaamixxe galcha'ni hedheeka Gibi'aka arda adhdhatee'e duulake sannachchi'aa gala'a uwwaashsha Isira'eelk mini hadi duuchchixxe oddonaa'ni dhibbakenaa'ni tomme, kumakenaa'ni dhibba, tomme kuminaa'ni mitte kuma manna dhaanbannon.» <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Tennexxe Isira'eelk ardi duuuchchi ookkone qachcha'ni lola ke'issate'e mitteba bukki hine.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Isira'eelik mini hadi Biiniyaamik mini hadi duuchchi'a erganjuwwa hine erginee qici, «Ha'nooxxe oddo'ni assendeexxi tinni fuggoxxi huje maachcho? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Ta'anna insa'nee shinne tennee fuggoxxa huje Isira'eelk giddii'ni fugusino, ookkone Gibi'aka baashshe manna no'aa sa'isitine uwwe.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:13">Yaane kinn Biiniyaamik ardi ifixxe gosaka Isira'eeltotika yaada adhdhineemabaan. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Tennexxe insa'ne Isira'eelk arda lolatee Biiniyaanuke qachchuwwa duuchchanaa'ni bukki hineexxi ifi ifike qachchanaa'ni Gibi'a dange. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Eettene barra ifi ifike qachchannaa'ni dageek Biiniyaamik manni laako'eme, laakosi insa'nekinna Gibi'ake manni gadho wele lame tommenna jaane kuma wolaantichcha kadheek manni hedheman, Gibi'aa'ninna torbaane dhibba filemeek manni laako'eme. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />Ookkonneer giddii'ni filemeek torbaan dhibb bitaachchiink mannammani; kunniirinna kino qolaanchaakeranna wele dhiisini darbinee'na umiink ordichcho midde qoxaakeerramman. <verse eid="JDG 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />Isira'eelk manni Biiniyaamik mini hado lephphinebaang wolaantichcha kadhdheek shool dhibba kuma loliinka manna bukki assine.<verse eid="JDG 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />Isira'eelk manni ke'ee Beeti'eeli'a dageexxi Magenokanna, «Biiniyaamika manna lolatee oddo no'oxxenaa'ni ayyete edis fulaa?» Hine qorre.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:18">Iikki Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna, «Yihudak gosatik mini hadi edise duulowwaali» hiyye hiise.<verse eid="JDG 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Gorsa bariisa Isira'eelk manni ke'eexxi Gibi'ake bogi bira qecence; <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Isira'eelk manni Biiniyaamika manna lolatee'e me'ine; Gibi'a giddo assinaake loli'a ifi ifika booncho abixxine. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Biiniyaamik manni Gibi'a'ni fulle; eettene barra Isira'eelito giddii'ni lame tommenna lame kuma manna shinne. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22" />Kaddo malee'e Isira'eelito weli'aan weli jajjabaanteexxi sirtixxa barra toora abixineemmake booncho'ni higgeen ifi ifika booncho abixine. <verse eid="JDG 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23" />Isira'eelk manni fuleexxi galgal qico'ni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo oo'ne. Insa'nenna hiisinexxi Duuchchi Woddika Goottanna, «Dayyuwwa no'oka Biiniyaamika manna lollonaa higgeen fullano?» Hine qorre.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:23">Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna, «Eetti martine insa'ne lolle» hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Langa baro Isira'eelik manni Biiniyaamike sannachchibaa duule. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Iitte wodda Biiniyamik manni Isira'eelika manna lolatee Gibi'a'ni fulle; higgeen wolaantichcha ka'leeka tommenna saddeeta kuma manna shinne.<verse eid="JDG 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eelk ardi duuchchi Beeti'eeli'a fule; insa'nenna ookko oo'na'ni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo ofolle. Insa'nenna eettene barra bogi hashshaa qico'ni agabo goddo honse; insa'nenna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo ciincatika tolchanna mittoommiinka tolcha shiqinshe. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" />Isira'eelk manninna Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxa fedhi qorre. Ookkone wodda Mageniink kakotik taabooti ookko hedheman; <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" />ookkone baro'ni Aaroonik labbak belti, Ali'aazaarik labbaka belto Finihaasi Duuchchi Woddik Gootti edo ergatemaammaxxe Isiraa'elk manni Duuchchi Woddika Gootta, «Dayyuwwa no'oke Biiniyaamika manninni welti lola inbonna langaxxa fullanno moo waallanno» hine qorre. Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna, «Soodo anga ha'nooxxe'ni sa'isse uwwannon fulle!» Hiyye.<verse eid="JDG 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eelk manni Gibi'a qarqara'ni riphee gaada'neka manna uggine. <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Insa'nenna sakka baro Biiniyaamika sannachcha lollo'a fulle; insa'nenna konneechch edo assinemmashsha Gibi'aka manna lollo'a ifi ifika booncho abixxine. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Biiniyaamik manninna ookkone sannachchixxa duuka fullee wodda ookkone qachchinaa'ni bayyante me'inaashsha assemme. Insa'nenna edi woddishshanni ookkone sannachcha'ni lola sanfe; ookko'ninna Beeti'eeli'aanna Gibi'a me'amake oruwwa'ninna weldeenate'ni sase tomme Isira'eelika manna shinne.<verse eid="JDG 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Biiniyaamito, «Konneechchi edo assinenneshshanni insa'ne'e shinne birrennen» hine. Isira'eelik manninna bado insa'nexxe'ni, «Udumi'a hinge'nexxi ookkone qachchi giddii'n ookkone lumoke ho'lichcha'ni insa'ne fulchino» hine.<verse eid="JDG 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Isira'eelk manni duuchchi hedhemake boonchonaa'ni udumi'a hingeexxi Be'aalitaamari'a enqe'ne booncho abixine. Gibi'ake diida'ni riphphe'e heqqitaammaxxi Isira'eelito xalli hite leelite. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eelk ardi duuchchanaa'ni filemeek tommi kumi manni Gibi'a edii'ni lola ke'isse. Loli itti jabaatatenaa'ni kexxeexxa, Biinyaamito ba'nee insa'nexxi shiqqa'ni daggeexxa egeneemmabaan. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Isira'eelik ardi Biiniyaamika manna lole injifantaasha asse. Eettene barra Isira'eelik ardi Binyaamik manni giddii'ni lame tommenna onde kumanna mitte dhibba manna shinne. <verse eid="JDG 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Ookkoneechchi uduma iikki Biiniyaamik manni injifateemmeexxa egenne. Isira'eelik ardi kinni Gibi'ake loola'ni riphe gaada'neek bagedo'ni ifi addanteemaxxe'e Biinyaamke manni'a booncho wocci assine. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Ookko ripheemmak manni rakeexxi Gibi'a baaje, sho'omeemakinna fuleexxi ookkone qachcha duuchcha wolaantichchiinke shinne. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Ookko ripheemak manninna ookone qachchinaa'ni jabaxxi wiliile hurretishsha ke'isinaashsha Isira'eelk mannixxenna ripheeke mannixxe oddo'ni beesisi uggemmeeman. <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />Isira'eelik arda tenne uudeshanni illee iima udumi'a higaashsha weli aange. Insa'nenna Biiniyaamik manni lolake'ni midditte alfineexxi Isira'eelke loliinke manni giddii'ni insa'ne sase tomme manna shinnemmaxxe'e, «Konneechchi edo assineeneshanni ta'anna insa'nee kutti assineenen» hine afo'o fulche'naaman. <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Yaane kinni wiliile duummachchiinsha iimi'a fuldaamman. Biinyaamik manni uudumi'a uuda wodda iikki qachchi duuchchi giirati abideme bubbe iimi'a fuldaa'na uunde. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eelk ardi udumi'a enqedheexxi insa'nee lole miidhe; ookkone wodda Biiniyaamk manni rakko insa'ne'ni gelteexxa anfeexxi yo'oshsha alanne. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Tennexxe insa'ne Isira'eelk ardi edii'ni udumi'a enqe'neexxi qiilla gammoojek bogika ora baanje, kaddo malee'e insa'nenna bagedokenaa'ni baanje fula dandeenebaan; gargar hedheeke ifi ifik qachchanaa'ni dageek Isira'eelk manni insa'nee ookkoni shiye bire. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Isira'eelk ardi Biiniyaamik loliinka manna bunqeexxi Gibi'a'ni boroti darre hedheeke boonchi qico'ni shorrine madada insa'neka kutti assine. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Ookkone lola'ni Biiniyaamik manni giddii'ni jabak tommenna saddeeti kumi sannachchi shiyeme. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Insa'ne giddii'ni gateek higeexxi qiilla bogibaa Riimmoonixxe rassabaa baaje wodda, Isira'eelik manni orake'ni onde kum amanna insa'neka shilte. Higgeen Gidi'oomi qico'ni hordoffe daggeexxi lame kuma manna lenbe shinne. <verse eid="JDG 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />Eettene barra wolaantichcha ka'leek lame tommenna ondi kumi Biiniyaamik manni loliinke diida'ni ibe; kunni duuchchi jabake loliinke mannaman.<verse eid="JDG 20:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Yaane kinn jaane dhibbi manni udumi'a qiilla gammoojje giddo hedheeke Riimmoonixxe rassabaa baaje; insa'nenna ookko'o shoole agenjo ofolle. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Isira'eelik ardi Biiniyaamike bogibaa higeexxi insa'neka qachchuwwa duuchcha iittanni horekanna ookko'o alfineechcho duuchcha wolaantichchinn shinne. Insa'nenna ookkone loola'ni hedheeka qachchuwwa duuchcha giirati gunbe.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s1">Biiniyaamik Mini Hadi'a Uwweendeexxa Are</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Isira'eelk ardi Mitsipha bukki hinee wodda, «No'o giddii'ni mitti manjinna ifixxa meyyaxxa belto Biiniyaamik manni'a heerunsiissoqqe» hine afo'o weli sa'neennan. <verse eid="JDG 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Isira'eelik ardi Beeti'eeli'a dageexxi Mageni edo galgali qico'ni ofolleexxi hafuura gikki assine'e oo'neen. <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />Insa'nenna hinee qici, «Ee, Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Isira'eelike Magenoo! Tinni maaye'e Isira'eel'ni kadde? Techcho Isira'eelk mini hadi giddii'n hitta gophemmaa?» Hine. <verse eid="JDG 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Eettenee bariisa iikki ardi tolchimalcho giisseexxi ciincatika tolchanna mittoominka tolcha ookko shiqishe.<verse eid="JDG 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma iikki Isira'eelk ardi Mitsiphaa Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo bukki hinanno wodda ookko'a dagebaak gateek huun manjinna isi shiyemmowwaal hine jabaxxa kako kakanteemmaxxee «Iisra'eelke mini hadi duuchchi Duuchchi Woddike Goottike ya'ibaa dagebaak gateek ayyetee?» Hine qorre. <verse eid="JDG 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Iikki Isira'eelk ardi dayyuwwa insa'neke Biiniyaamik manni'a lumoshsha yaandeemmaxxee, «Telcho Isira'eelk mini hadi giddii'n mitte gosa baxxe'en. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />No'oxxe meyyaxxe oose giddii'n konne Biinyaamike manni'a aadhinsabo'noxxa Duuchchi Woddike Goottike summinni kakanteenaxxe'e weli gateeki are alfaashsha maa assinanno?» Hine.<verse eid="JDG 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Insa'ne hinee qici: «Isira'eelik mini hadi giddii'n Mitsipha Duuchchi Woddike Goottik ya'i edo fulbaak gateek ayyetee?» Hine qore. Iyyabiisi Gele'aadi giddii'n mitti manjinna kaambetiba'a ookkone ya'iba dagebaaxxa anfe. <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Insa'nenna ookkone sannachcha laakkoono'aa mitti mittingika summa ye'naa wodda Iyyabiisi Gele'adik manninaa'ni mitti manjinna hedhemabaan. <verse eid="JDG 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Tennexxe'e ya'i ookkone tommenna lame kuma jabaka manna ergineexxi, «Martinne Iyyabiisi Gele'adi'ni hedheeka manna melaalendinnni oosendinni welti wolaantichchik shiwwe.» <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />Insa'nenna «Assiyyo hasisaaxxi ookkone labballo duuchcha iittanni heerundeexxa melaalle duuchcha shiltine birre» hine ajaja uune. <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Insa'nenna Iyyabiisi Gele'adii hedha'neke ardi giddii'ni shoole dhibba duuddo dubara anfe; tennexxe insa'nee'e Kenaanike boga'ni Seelo hiyyemaake looliba aa'ne dange.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Ookkoneechchi uduma iikki ya'i duuchchi Riimmoonixxe rassa'ni hedheeke Biiniyaamike manniba'a nage'iinka dhaansa erge. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Tennexxe ookkone wodda iikki Biiniyaamiki manni udumi'aa hige; weli gatteexxa Isira'eelito reyotenaa'n gateek Iyyabiisi Gele'adii'ni booji'eme dageeka dubaruwwa insa'ne'a uune. Yaane kinn ookkone dubarki laakosi duuchchinge geyaakemabaan.<verse eid="JDG 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelike mini hadixxe oddo'ni mittunte hexxabaashsha asseemmaxxe'e ardi Biiniyaamixxee'e yo'oshsha yaade. <verse eid="JDG 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Ookkone ya'iki akeekisanjuwwi hiyyee qici, «Yoonna Biiniyaamike mini hadik dubarri muddeedheen; eega gateeke labbali'a are habaa'ni alfa dandeenannoo? <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Isira'eelik mini hadi giddii'ni mitti mini hadi midde ba'abaashsha ta'a hedhoti hedheek Biiniyaamik mani hadi dhaaldaaxxa sanne ifi'a hasisaan. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Kaddo malee no'o giddii'n mitti manjinna dubarcho ifixxa Biiniyaamichchokee aadhisoole yowwemeeke kadeexxa kakateemmaxxe'e dubarra no'oka aa'naashsha eetti'i insa'ne'a uunabo'non; <verse eid="JDG 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />yaane kinni Beeteli'ni bita'i darre'ninna Beeti'eeli'ni Sekemi'a me'amake orii'n boroti darre'ni iittanni Leboonii'ni bita'i darre'ni hedheeke Seelo Duuchchi Woddike Goottik ayyaani wogga woggande'ni ulfeeseman.» <verse eid="JDG 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Tennexxe Biiniyaamito insa'nee hinee qici: «Martine woyinetke hiddichchiink booncho'ni sho'omme; <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />ookko'o riphphine insa'ne gaadde. Seelok dubarri siribake ookko'a dagaa wodda, woyinetike hiddichchiinke boonchonaa'ni ha'no fuldineexxi ookkone dubar giddii'ni ifi ifi'aa arete kaddaaxxa aadhdhe; ookkonnechi uduma insa'ne Biiniyaamixxe galchabaa a'litine me'e. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Annuwwi insa'neekinna dayyuwwi insa'nek kaddabaan hinoole, ‹Lolii wodda mitte mittengee are assedhatee aane'naxxi duullasha assine tirtirsineenaxxe'e ballo no'aa gattowwaal hiyye; ha'noonna eetti ha'nooxinn no'aa uwwa gophphineemmaxxe'e asse'neennek hunnati kako ha'nooxxa diigine ballesanote kadinabaan› hitine hiissichcho no'aa uutineele eloxxemman.»<verse eid="JDG 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Iikki Biiniyaamik mani hadinna insa'ne'ni kulndeeshanni assine; iikki dubar siribamma wodda lmitti mitting manji mitte mitte dubara are ifixxe assedho'aa adhdhe me'e; ookkoneechi uduma insa'nenna ifi ifke bogiba hinge; qachchuwwa insaa'nekanna qammalchine ookko'o hedha sanfe. <verse eid="JDG 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Eettene yanna Isira'eelik ardi ookkone booncho waalexxi ifi ifike miniba, ifi ifke bogibaa, ifi ifixxe gosabaanna ifi ifke mini mini hadibaaduuchchi me'ate'e qophpheefante: mitti mittingi ifi ifike mini minibaanna mini hadibaa me'ine.<verse eid="JDG 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />Ookkone baro'ni Isira'eelik boga'n moyanji hedhemmabaan; mitti mitting manji duuchchi ifi'a eloxxe fakkaatee leelitteexxa assaaman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 17:6">Hay. 17:6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>